hadiths[253]{hadithnumber,text}:
"705","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Asma bint Umais se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Baida mein Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ko janam diya, to Abu Bakr ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to Aap ne farmaya ke use hukm do ke ghusl kare phir ehlal kare."
"706","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Asma bint Umais ne Zul Hulaifa mein Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ko janam diya to Abu Bakr ne unhein hukm diya ke ghusl karein phir ehlal karein."
"707","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar apne ehram ke liye ghusl karte they is se pehle ke ehram bandhein, aur Makka mein dakhil hone ke liye aur Arafa ki shaam wuqoof ke liye."
"708","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Hunain se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Abbas aur Miswar bin Makhrama ka Abwa mein ikhtilaf hua to Abdullah ne kaha ke muhrim apna sar dhoye aur Miswar bin Makhrama ne kaha ke muhrim apna sar na dhoye. Unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Abbas ne mujhe Abu Ayyub Ansari ke paas bheja to maine unhein do lakdiyon ke darmiyan ghusl karte paya jabke wo kapde se parda kiye hue they to maine unhein salam kya to unhon ne kaha ke ye kaun hai to maine kaha ke main Abdullah bin Hunain hun, mujhe Abdullah bin Abbas ne aap ke paas bheja hai, aap se puchhta hun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ehram ki halat mein apna sar kaise dhote they. Unhon ne kaha ke Abu Ayyub ne kapde par apna haath rakha aur use jhukaya yahan tak ke un ka sar mujhe nazar aane laga phir unhon ne pani dalne wale shakhs se kaha ke dalo to us ne un ke sar par pani dala phir unhon ne apne dono haathon se apna sar harkat di, unhein aage lae aur peechhe le gae, phir kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko isi tarah karte dekha."
"709","Mujhe Malik ne Humaid bin Qais se, unhon ne Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Yala bin Munya se kaha jabke wo Umar bin Khattab par pani dal rahe they aur wo ghusl kar rahe they ke mere sar par dalo. To Yala ne kaha ke kya aap chahte hain ke use mere zimme kar dein, agar aap mujhe hukm dein to main dalun. To Umar bin Khattab ne un se kaha ke dalo, pani use maila hone ke siwa kuchh na badhayega."
"710","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab Makka ke qareeb hote to Zu Tuwa mein do ghatiyon ke darmiyan raat guzarte yahan tak ke subah hoti phir subah ki namaz padhte phir us ghati se dakhil hote jo Makka ke upar ki taraf hai, aur jab hajj ya umra ke liye nikle hue hote to dakhil na hote yahan tak ke Makka mein dakhil hone se pehle ghusl karte jab Makka ke qareeb Zu Tuwa mein hote, aur apne sathiyon ko hukm dete to wo dakhil hone se pehle ghusl karte."
"711","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ehram ki halat mein apna sar na dhote magar ehtelam ki wajah se. Malik ne kaha ke maine ahl-e-ilm ko kehte suna ke muhrim mard ke liye koi harj nahi ke ghusool se apna sar dhoye jamra-e-aqaba ko rami karne ke baad aur apna sar mundwane se pehle, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke jab us ne jamra-e-aqaba ko rami kar li to us ke liye juen marna aur baal mundwana aur mail door karna aur kapde pehenna halal ho gaya."
"712","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se pucha ke muhrim kapdon mein se kya pehne to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qameesein na pehno aur na amame aur na shalwarein aur na burnus aur na moze magar koi shakhs jo do jootiyan na paye to do moze pehne aur unhein takhnon se neeche kaat le, aur kapdon mein se koi cheez na pehno jise zafran ya wars laga ho."
"713","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke muhrim aisa kapda pehne jo zafran ya wars se ranga gaya ho aur farmaya ke jo do jootiyan na paye to do moze pehne aur unhein takhnon se neeche kaat le."
"714","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ke azad karda Aslam ko Abdullah bin Umar se bayan karte suna ke Umar bin Khattab ne Talha bin Ubaidullah par ranga hua kapda dekha jabke wo muhrim they to Umar ne kaha ke ye ranga hua kapda kaisa hai aye Talha. To Talha ne kaha ke aye Ameerul Momineen ye to madar hai. To Umar ne kaha ke tum aye jamaat aise imam ho jin ki log pairwi karte hain to agar koi jahil shakhs is kapde ko dekhe to kahega ke Talha bin Ubaidullah ehram mein range hue kapde pehente they, to aye jamaat in range hue kapdon mein se koi cheez na pehno."
"715","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ki beti Asma se riwayat kya ke wo gehre usfur se range hue kapde pehenti thin jabke wo muhrima thin, un mein zafran na hota. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se us kapde ke bare mein pucha gaya jise khushbu lagi ho phir us se khushbu ki boo jati rahe ke kya is mein ehram bandha jae to unhon ne kaha ke haan, jab tak is mein zafran ya wars ka rang na ho."
"716","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar muhrim ke liye kamarband pehenne ko makrooh samajhte they."
"717","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke kamarband ke bare mein jo muhrim apne kapdon ke neeche pehenta hai ke is mein koi harj nahi jab wo us ke dono kinaron ko tasme banae jin mein se baaz ko baaz se bandhe. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi mujhe sab se pasand hai."
"718","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Hanfi Farafisa bin Umair ne khabar di ke unhon ne Usman bin Affan ko Araj mein dekha ke wo apna chehra dhanp rahe they jabke wo muhrim they."
"719","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke thodi se upar jo sar mein se hai use muhrim na dhanpe."
"720","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne apne bete Waqid bin Abdullah ko kafan diya jabke wo Juhfa mein muhrim hokar mar gaya tha aur unhon ne us ka sar aur chehra dhanpa aur kaha ke agar hum hurmat wale na hote to use khushbu lagate. Malik ne kaha ke aadmi amal karta hai jab tak zinda hai phir jab mar jae to amal khatm ho gaya."
"721","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke muhrim aurat naqab na kare aur na dastane pehne."
"722","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne Munzir ki beti Fatima se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum apne chehre dhanpti thin jabke hum muhrimat thin aur hum Abu Bakr Siddiq ki beti Asma ke sath thin."
"723","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko un ke ehram ke liye khushbu lagati thi is se pehle ke wo ehram bandhte aur un ke halal hone ke liye is se pehle ke wo Baitullah ka tawaf karte."
"724","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Humaid bin Qais se, unhon ne Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat kya ke aik dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap Hunain mein they aur dehati par qamees thi aur is mein zardi ka nishan tha to us ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah maine umre ka ehlal kya hai to aap mujhe kya hukm dete hain ke main karun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke apni qamees utar do aur ye zardi apne upar se dho dalo aur apne umre mein wahi karo jo apne hajj mein karte ho."
"725","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ke azad karda Aslam se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Shajara mein khushbu ki boo payi to kaha ke ye khushbu ki boo kis se hai. To Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ne kaha ke mujh se hai aye Ameerul Momineen. To unhon ne kaha ke tum se hai, Allah ki umr ki qasam. To Muawiya ne kaha ke Umm Habiba ne mujhe khushbu lagai hai aye Ameerul Momineen. To Umar ne kaha ke main tum par qasam deta hun ke zaroor lautoge phir use dho daaloge."
"726","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Salt bin Zubaid se, unhon ne apne ghar walon mein se aik se zyada afrad se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Shajara mein khushbu ki boo payi aur un ke pehlu mein Kaseer bin Salt they to Umar ne kaha ke ye khushbu ki boo kis se hai. To Kaseer ne kaha ke mujh se hai aye Ameerul Momineen, maine apna sar jamaya hai aur main chahta hun ke na mundwaun. To Umar ne kaha ke Sharba ki taraf jao aur apna sar malo yahan tak ke use saaf karo. To Kaseer bin Salt ne aisa kya. Malik ne kaha ke Sharba garha hai jo khajoor ke darakht ki jad ke paas hota hai."
"727","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed aur Abdullah bin Abi Bakr aur Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Waleed bin Abdul Malik ne Salim bin Abdullah aur Kharija bin Zaid bin Sabit se jamra ko rami karne aur sar mundwane ke baad aur tawaf-e-ifaza se pehle khushbu ke bare mein pucha to Salim ne use mana kya aur Kharija bin Zaid bin Sabit ne use rukhsat di. Malik ne kaha ke mard ke liye koi harj nahi ke aise tel se tel lagae jis mein khushbu na ho, ehram bandhne se pehle aur Mina se ifaza se pehle jamra ki rami ke baad. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se us khane ke bare mein pucha gaya jis mein zafran ho ke kya use muhrim khae to unhon ne kaha ke jo is mein se aag ko chhue to muhrim ke liye use khane mein koi harj nahi, aur jo is mein se aag ko na chhue to use muhrim na khae."
"728","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Madina wale Zul Hulaifa se ehlal karein aur Sham wale Juhfa se ehlal karein aur Najd wale Qarn se ehlal karein. Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aur Yaman wale Yalamlam se ehlal karein."
"729","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Madina walon ko hukm diya ke Zul Hulaifa se ehlal karein aur Sham wale Juhfa se aur Najd wale Qarn se. Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke in teen ko to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna aur mujhe khabar di gayi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aur Yaman wale Yalamlam se ehlal karein."
"730","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Fara se ehlal karte they."
"731","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne apne nazdeek bharose wale shakhs se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Ilya se ehlal karte they."
"732","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jirana se umre ka ehlal kya."
"733","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka talbiya tha ke hazir hun aye Allah hazir hun, hazir hun tera koi shareek nahi hazir hun, beshak hamd aur nemat tere liye hai aur badshahi, tera koi shareek nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar is mein izafa karte they ke hazir hun hazir hun hazir hun aur saadatmand hun aur bhalai tere haath mein hai hazir hun aur raghbat teri taraf hai aur amal."
"734","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zul Hulaifa ki masjid mein do rakatein padhte phir jab Aap ki oontni Aap ko lekar seedhi ho jati to ehlal karte."
"735","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Musa bin Uqba se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne apne walid ko kehte suna ke ye tumhara Baida hai jis mein tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jhoot bolte ho, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ehlal na kya magar masjid ke paas se, yani Zul Hulaifa ki masjid."
"736","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Maqbari Saeed bin Abi Saeed se, unhon ne Ubaid bin Juraij se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman maine aap ko chaar kaam karte dekha maine aap ke sathiyon mein se kisi ko inhein karte na dekha. Unhon ne kaha ke wo kya hain aye Ibn Juraij. Unhon ne kaha ke maine aap ko dekha ke aap arkan mein se Yamani arkan ke siwa hath na lagate, aur maine aap ko dekha ke aap Sabti jootiyan pehente, aur maine aap ko dekha ke aap zardi se rangte, aur maine aap ko dekha ke jab aap Makka mein hote to log ehlal karte jab chand dekhte aur aap ehlal na karte yahan tak ke tarwiya ka din hota. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke arkan ka muamla ye hai ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Yamani arkan ke siwa hath lagate na dekha, aur Sabti jootiyon ka muamla ye hai ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap aisi jootiyan pehente jin mein baal na hote aur un mein wuzu karte to main pasand karta hun ke inhein pehnun, aur zardi ka muamla ye hai ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is se rangte dekha to main pasand karta hun ke is se rangun, aur ehlal ka muamla ye hai ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ehlal karte na dekha yahan tak ke Aap ki oontni Aap ko lekar chal padti."
"737","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Zul Hulaifa ki masjid mein namaz padhte they."
"738","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Abdul Malik bin Marwan ne Zul Hulaifa ki masjid ke paas se ehlal kya jab us ki oontni use lekar seedhi hui aur Uthman ke bete Aban ne use is ka mashwara diya tha."
"739","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Abdul Haris bin Hisham ke bete Abdul Malik bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Ansari Khalad bin Saib se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere paas Jibreel ae aur unhon ne mujhe hukm diya ke main apne sahaba ko ya jo mere sath hon unhein hukm dun ke apni aawazein talbiya ya ehlal se buland karein. Wo in dono mein se aik chahte hain."
"740","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdul Rahman ke bete Abu Aswad Muhammad se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Hujjatul Wida ke saal nikle to hum mein se kisi ne umre ka ehlal kya aur hum mein se kisi ne hajj aur umre ka ehlal kya aur hum mein se kisi ne hajj ka ehlal kya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hajj ka ehlal kya, to jo umre ka ehlal karke aaya tha wo halal ho gaya, aur jo hajj ka ya hajj aur umre dono ka ehlal karke aaya tha wo halal na hue yahan tak ke Nahr ka din aaya."
"741","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hajj ko mufrad kya."
"742","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdul Rahman ke bete Abu Aswad Muhammad se riwayat kya ke wo Zubair ke bete Urwa ki parwarish mein yateem they, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hajj ko mufrad kya."
"743","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Miqdad bin Aswad Suqya mein Ali bin Abi Talib ke paas dakhil hue jabke wo apne oonton ke liye bareek aata aur patte jhad rahe they to unhon ne kaha ke ye Usman bin Affan hajj aur umre ko jama karne se mana karte hain. To Ali bin Abi Talib nikle jabke un ke dono haathon par aate aur patton ka nishan tha, main aate aur patton ka nishan un ki kalaiyon par kabhi na bhulunga, yahan tak ke Usman bin Affan ke paas dakhil hue to kaha ke kya tum hajj aur umre ko jama karne se mana karte ho. To Usman ne kaha ke ye meri rai hai. To Ali gusse mein nikle jabke wo kehte they ke hazir hun aye Allah hazir hun hajj aur umre dono ke sath. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm ye hai ke jo hajj aur umre ko jama kare wo apne baalon mein se kuchh na le aur kisi cheez se halal na ho yahan tak ke qurbani zibah kare agar us ke sath ho aur Mina mein Nahr ke din halal ho."
"744","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hujjatul Wida ke saal hajj ke liye nikle to Aap ke sahaba mein se kisi ne hajj ka ehlal kya aur un mein se kisi ne hajj aur umre ko jama kya aur un mein se kisi ne umre ka ehlal kya, to jo hajj ka ya hajj aur umre ko jama karke aaya tha wo halal na hua aur jo umre ka ehlal karke aaya tha wo halal ho gae. Aur mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne baaz ahl-e-ilm ko kehte suna ke jo umre ka ehlal kare phir us ke liye zahir ho ke us ke sath hajj ka ehlal kare to ye us ke liye hai jab tak wo Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai na kare, aur Ibn Umar ne aisa kya jab unhon ne kaha ke agar main Baitullah se rok diya gaya to hum waisa kareinge jaisa hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath kya, phir apne sahaba ki taraf mutawajjeh hue to kaha ke in dono ka muamla to aik hai, main tumhein gawah karta hun ke maine umre ke sath hajj wajib kar liya. Malik ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba ne Hujjatul Wida ke saal umre ka ehlal kya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke jis ke sath hadi ho wo hajj ka ehlal umre ke sath kare phir halal na ho yahan tak ke in dono se halal ho."
"745","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Saqafi Muhammad bin Abi Bakr se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se pucha jabke wo dono Mina se Arafa ki taraf subah ja rahe they ke tum is din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath kya karte they. Unhon ne kaha ke hum mein se ehlal karne wala ehlal karta to us par inkar na kya jata aur takbeer kehne wala takbeer kehta to us par inkar na kya jata."
"746","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Ali bin Abi Talib hajj mein talbiya kehte yahan tak ke jab Arafa ke din suraj dhal jata to talbiya qata kar dete. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke yehi wo muamla hai jis par hamare shehar ke ahl-e-ilm hamesha se hain."
"747","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke wo talbiya chhor deti thin jab Mawqif ki taraf laut tin."
"748","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar hajj mein talbiya qata kar dete jab Haram tak pahunchte yahan tak ke Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai karte phir talbiya kehte yahan tak ke Mina se Arafa ki taraf subah jate, phir jab subah jate to talbiya chhor dete, aur umre mein talbiya chhor dete jab Haram mein dakhil hote."
"749","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke Abdullah bin Umar Baitullah ka tawaf karte hue talbiya na kehte they."
"750","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Alqama ke bete Abi Alqama se, unhon ne apni walida se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke wo Arafa se Namira mein utarti thin phir Arak ki taraf muntaqil ho jati thin. Unhon ne kaha ke Aaisha ehlal karti thin jab tak apne thikane mein hotin aur jo un ke sath hote, phir jab sawaar hotin aur Mawqif ki taraf mutawajjeh hotin to ehlal chhor detin. Unhon ne kaha ke Aaisha hajj ke baad Makka se Zul Hijja mein umra karti thin phir ye chhor diya to Muharram ka chand nazar aane se pehle nikal tin yahan tak ke Juhfa aatin aur wahan theharti thin yahan tak ke chand dekhtin, phir jab chand dekhtin to umre ka ehlal kartin."
"751","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz Arafa ke din Mina se subah gae to unhon ne buland takbeer suni to pehredaron ko bheja ke logon mein pukaro ke aye logon ye talbiya hai."
"752","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke aye Makka walo logon ka kya haal hai ke wo paragan aate hain aur tum tel lagaye hue ho, ehlal karo jab chand dekho."
"753","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Zubair Makka mein nau saal thehre, Zul Hijja ke chand ke liye hajj ka ehlal karte aur Zubair ke bete Urwa un ke sath aisa karte. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke Makka wale aur un ke ilawa hajj ka ehlal tab karte hain jab wo wahan hon, aur jo Makka mein muqeem ho Makka walon ke ilawa Makka ke andar se Haram se bahar na nikle. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke jo Makka se hajj ka ehlal kare wo Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai ko moakhir kare yahan tak ke Mina se laute, aur isi tarah Abdullah bin Umar ne kya. Aur Malik se us shakhs ke bare mein pucha gaya jo Madina walon ya un ke ilawa mein se Makka se Zul Hijja ke chand ke liye hajj ka ehlal kare ke wo tawaf se kya kare. Unhon ne kaha ke wajib tawaf ko moakhir kare aur yehi wo hai jise wo Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai se milae, aur jitna chahe tawaf kare aur jab saat phere tawaf kare to do rakatein padhe, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba ne aisa kya jinhon ne hajj ka ehlal kya to unhon ne Baitullah ke tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai ko moakhir kya yahan tak ke Mina se laute, aur Abdullah bin Umar ne aisa kya, wo Makka se Zul Hijja ke chand ke liye hajj ka ehlal karte aur Baitullah ke tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai ko moakhir karte yahan tak ke Mina se laute. Aur Malik se Makka wale mard ke bare mein pucha gaya ke kya wo Makka ke andar se umre ka ehlal kare. Unhon ne kaha ke balke Hill ki taraf nikle phir wahan se ehram bandhe."
"754","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Abu Sufyan ke bete Ziyad ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ko likha ke Abdullah bin Abbas ne kaha ke jo hadi bheje us par wo haram ho jata hai jo haji par haram hota hai yahan tak ke hadi zibah kare, aur maine hadi bheji hai to mujhe apne hukm se likho ya hadi wale ko hukm do. Amra ne kaha ke Aaisha ne kaha ke jaisa Ibn Abbas ne kaha waisa nahi, maine apne haath se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadi ke haar bante phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne haath se unhein hadi ko pehnaya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use mere walid ke sath bheja to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par koi cheez haram na hui jo Allah ne un ke liye halal ki thi yahan tak ke hadi zibah ki."
"755","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se us shakhs ke bare mein pucha jo apni hadi bhejta hai aur muqeem rehta hai ke kya us par koi cheez haram hoti hai. To unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Aaisha ko kehte suna ke haram nahi hota magar jo ehlal kare aur talbiya kahe."
"756","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Haris Taimi ke bete Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne Hudair ke bete Abdullah ke bete Rabia se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Iraq mein aik mard ko libas utare dekha to logon se us ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke use us ki hadi ke bare mein hukm diya gaya hai ke use haar pehnaya jae is liye us ne libas utara. Rabia ne kaha ke main Abdullah bin Zubair se mila aur un se is ka zikr kya to unhon ne kaha ke Kaaba ke Rab ki qasam bidat hai. Aur Malik se us shakhs ke bare mein pucha gaya jo apne liye hadi lekar nikla phir Zul Hulaifa mein use ishara kya aur haar pehnaya aur wo khud ehram na bandhe yahan tak ke Juhfa aaya. Unhon ne kaha ke main is ko pasand nahi karta aur us ne jo kya us mein durust na kya aur us ke liye jaiz nahi ke hadi ko haar pehnae aur na use ishara kare magar ehlal ke waqt, magar wo mard jo hajj ka irada na rakhe to use bheje aur apne ghar walon mein muqeem rahe. Aur Malik se pucha gaya ke kya hadi ko baghair ehram ke nikala jae. To unhon ne kaha ke haan, is mein koi harj nahi. Aur un se is ke bare mein bhi pucha gaya jis mein logon ne ikhtilaf kya ke hadi ka haar pehnane ke liye ehram bandha jae us shakhs se jo hajj ya umre ka irada na rakhe. To unhon ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek wo hukm jis par hum amal karte hain is bare mein Momineen ki maan Aaisha ka qaul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni hadi bheji phir muqeem rahe to Aap par koi cheez haram na hui jo Allah ne un ke liye halal ki thi yahan tak ke unhon ne apni hadi zibah ki."
"757","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke haiza aurat jo hajj ya umre ka ehlal kare wo apne hajj ya umre ka ehlal kare jab chahe lekin Baitullah ka tawaf na kare aur na Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan, aur wo tamam manasik mein logon ke sath hazir ho siwae is ke ke wo Baitullah ka tawaf na kare aur na Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan aur pak hone tak masjid ke qareeb na jae."
"758","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen umre kiye, Hudaibiya ke saal aur Qaza ke saal aur Jirana ke saal."
"759","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen ke siwa umra na kya, un mein se aik Shawwal mein aur do Zul Qaada mein."
"760","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Aslami Abdur Rahman bin Harmala se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Saeed bin Musayyab se pucha aur kaha ke kya main hajj se pehle umra karun. To Saeed ne kaha ke haan, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hajj se pehle umra kya."
"761","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Abu Salma ke bete Umar ne Umar bin Khattab se ijazat mangi ke Shawwal mein umra kare to unhon ne use ijazat di to us ne umra kya phir apne ghar walon ki taraf laut aaya aur hajj na kya."
"762","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo umre mein talbiya qata karte jab Haram mein dakhil hote. Malik ne kaha ke jo Taneem se ehram bandhe us ke bare mein ke wo talbiya qata karta hai jab Baitullah dekhe. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo baaz meeqaton se umra kare jabke wo Madina walon ya un ke ilawa mein se ho ke wo talbiya kab qata kare. Unhon ne kaha ke jo meeqaton se ehlal kare wo talbiya qata karta hai jab Haram tak pahunche. Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar aisa karte they."
"763","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Naufal ke bete Abdul Muttalib ke bete Haris ke bete Abdullah ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein bayan kya ke unhon ne Waqqas ke bete Saad aur Qais ke bete Dahhak ko Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ke hajj ke saal suna jabke wo umre se hajj tak tamattu ka zikr kar rahe they to Qais ke bete Dahhak ne kaha ke aisa na kare magar jo Allah Azza wa Jal ke hukm se jahil ho. To Saad ne kaha ke aye bhatije tum ne buri baat kahi. To Dahhak ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab ne is se mana kya hai. To Saad ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ise kya aur hum ne Aap ke sath ise kya."
"764","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sadaqa se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ke main hajj se pehle umra karun aur hadi dun ye mujhe is se zyada pasand hai ke hajj ke baad Zul Hijja mein umra karun."
"765","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jo hajj ke mahinon mein Shawwal ya Zul Qaada ya Zul Hijja mein hajj se pehle umra kare phir Makka mein muqeem rahe yahan tak ke use hajj pa le to wo mutamatti hai agar hajj kare aur us par jo hadi aasan ho, phir jo na paye to hajj mein teen din roza aur saat jab laute. Malik ne kaha ke ye tab hai jab muqeem rahe yahan tak ke hajj aae phir usi saal hajj kare. Malik ne kaha ke Makka wale mard ke bare mein jo kahin aur chala gaya aur us ke siwa kahin raha phir hajj ke mahinon mein umra karte hue aaya phir Makka mein muqeem raha yahan tak ke wahan se hajj shuru kya ke wo mutamatti hai us par hadi wajib hai ya roza agar hadi na paye aur wo Makka walon jaisa na hoga. Aur Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo Makka walon ke ilawa mein se Makka mein hajj ke mahinon mein umre ke sath dakhil hua jabke wo Makka mein muqeem rehne ka irada rakhta hai yahan tak ke hajj shuru kare ke kya wo mutamatti hai. To unhon ne kaha ke haan wo mutamatti hai aur wo Makka walon jaisa nahi agarche muqeem rehne ka irada rakhe, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke wo Makka mein dakhil hua jabke wo us ke rehne walon mein se nahi, aur hadi ya roza to us par hai jo Makka walon mein se na ho, aur ye mard muqeem rehne ka irada rakhta hai aur nahi janta ke is ke baad us par kya zahir ho jabke wo Makka walon mein se nahi."
"766","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke jo Shawwal ya Zul Qaada ya Zul Hijja mein umra kare phir Makka mein muqeem rahe yahan tak ke use hajj pa le to wo mutamatti hai agar hajj kare aur jo hadi aasan ho, phir jo na paye to hajj mein teen din roza aur saat jab laute."
"767","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ke azad karda Suma se, unhon ne Abu Saleh Samman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke umre se umre tak in ke darmiyan ka kaffara hai aur hajj-e-mabroor ka badla Jannat ke siwa kuchh nahi."
"768","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ke azad karda Suma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ko kehte suna ke aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha ke main hajj ke liye taiyar hui thi phir mujhe rukawat pesh aayi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke Ramzan mein umra karo kyunke is mein umra hajj jaisa hai."
"769","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke apne hajj aur umre ke darmiyan fasla karo kyunke ye tum mein se aik ke hajj ke liye zyada mukammal aur us ke umre ke liye zyada mukammal hai ke wo hajj ke mahinon ke ilawa mein umra kare."
"770","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Usman bin Affan jab umra karte to kabhi apni sawari se na utarte yahan tak ke laut aate. Malik ne kaha ke umra sunnat hai aur hum kisi musalman ko nahi jante jis ne use chhorne ki rukhsat di. Malik ne kaha ke main kisi ke liye nahi samajhta ke saal mein baar baar umra kare. Malik ne kaha ke motamir ke bare mein jo apni biwi se sohbat kare ke us par is mein hadi hai aur dusra umra hai jise wo us ke mukammal karne ke baad shuru kare jo us ne fasid kya aur ehram bandhe jahan se us ne apne us umre ka ehram bandha tha jo us ne fasid kya, magar ke wo apne meeqat se zyada door jagah se ehram bandhe to us par lazim nahi ke ehram bandhe magar apne meeqat se. Malik ne kaha ke jo Makka mein umre ke sath dakhil ho phir Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare jabke wo junubi ho ya baghair wuzu ke ho phir apni biwi se sohbat kare phir yaad kare. Unhon ne kaha ke ghusl kare ya wuzu kare phir laute aur Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare aur dusra umra kare aur hadi de, aur aurat par jab us ka shohar use pahunche jabke wo muhrima ho usi jaisa hai. Malik ne kaha ke Taneem se umre ka muamla ye hai ke jo chahe ke Haram se nikle phir ehram bandhe to ye us ke liye kafi hai agar Allah chahe lekin fazilat ye hai ke us meeqat se ehlal kare jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muqarrar kya ya jo Taneem se zyada door ho."
"771","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Abdur Rahman Rabia se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Rafi aur Ansar mein se aik mard ko bheja to un dono ne Maimuna bint Haris ka nikah karaya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina mein they is se pehle ke niklein."
"772","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdul Dar ke bhai Wahb ke bete Nabih se riwayat kya ke Ubaidullah ke bete Umar ne Uthman ke bete Aban ko bheja jabke Aban us din hajiyon ke ameer they aur wo dono muhrim they ke maine Talha bin Umar ka Jubair ke bete Shaiba ki beti se nikah karne ka irada kya hai aur main chahta hun ke tum hazir ho. To Aban ne us par inkar kya aur kaha ke maine Usman bin Affan ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke muhrim na nikah kare aur na us ka nikah karaya jae aur na paigham de."
"773","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dawood bin Husain se riwayat kya ke Tarif Murri ke bete Abu Ghatfan ne unhein khabar di ke un ke walid Tarif ne aik aurat se nikah kya jabke wo muhrim they to Umar bin Khattab ne un ka nikah radd kar diya."
"774","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke muhrim na nikah kare aur na."
"775","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab aur Salim bin Abdullah aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se muhrim ke nikah ke bare mein pucha gaya to unhon ne kaha ke muhrim na nikah kare aur na us ka nikah karaya jae. Malik ne kaha ke muhrim mard ke bare mein ke wo apni biwi se ruju kare agar chahe jab wo us se iddat mein ho."
"776","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sar ke upar singhi lagwai jabke Aap muhrim they aur Aap us din Lahyi Jamal mein they jo Makka ke raaste mein jagah hai."
"777","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke muhrim singhi na lagwae magar jis se use koi chara na ho. Malik ne kaha ke muhrim singhi na lagwae magar zarurat se."
"778","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah Taimi ke azad karda Abu Nadr se, unhon ne Ansari Abu Qatada ke azad karda Nafi se, unhon ne Abu Qatada se riwayat kya ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they yahan tak ke jab wo Makka ke baaz raaste mein they to wo apne muhrim sathiyon ke sath peechhe reh gae jabke wo ghair muhrim they to unhon ne jangli gadha dekha aur apne ghode par seedhe hue phir apne sathiyon se manga ke unhein un ka koda dein to unhon ne inkar kya, phir un se un ka neza manga to unhon ne inkar kya, phir use liya aur gadhe par hamla kya aur use qatal kar diya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baaz sahaba ne is mein se khaya aur baaz ne inkar kya, phir jab wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunche to unhon ne Aap se is ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne farmaya ke ye to khana hai jo Allah ne tumhein khilaya."
"779","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Zubair bin Awwam hiran ke sukhe gosht ka tosha lete jabke wo muhrim hote. Malik ne kaha ke safeef qadeed hai."
"780","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Yasar ke bete Ata ne unhein Abu Qatada se jangli gadhe ke bare mein Abu Nadr ki hadis jaisa khabar di siwae is ke ke Zaid bin Aslam ki hadis mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tumhare paas is ke gosht mein se kuchh hai."
"781","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ansari Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Haris Taimi ke bete Muhammad bin Ibrahim ne, Talha bin Ubaidullah ke bete Isa se, Salma Damri ke bete Umair se, Bahzi se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka ka irada karte hue nikle jabke Aap muhrim they yahan tak ke jab Rauha mein they to achanak zakhmi jangli gadha tha to is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya gaya to Aap ne farmaya ke use chhor do kyunke qareeb hai ke us ka malik aae. To Bahzi jo us ka malik tha Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah aap is gadhe se jo chahein karein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr ko hukm diya to unhon ne use rafqon ke darmiyan taqseem kya phir aage badhe yahan tak ke jab Usaya mein they jo Ruwaitha aur Araj ke darmiyan hai to achanak saya mein ghaat lagaye hiran tha jis mein teer tha to wo kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik mard ko hukm diya ke us ke paas khada rahe, logon mein se koi use na darae yahan tak ke us se aage badh jaein."
"782","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko Abu Huraira se bayan karte suna ke wo Bahrain se aae yahan tak ke jab Rabaza mein they to Iraq walon ke aik sawaron ke garoh ko muhrim paya to unhon ne un se shikar ke gosht ke bare mein pucha jo unhon ne Rabaza walon ke paas paya tha to unhon ne unhein use khane ka hukm diya. Unhon ne kaha ke phir mujhe is mein shak hua jo maine unhein hukm diya tha, phir jab main Madina aaya to is ka zikr Umar bin Khattab se kya to Umar ne kaha ke tum ne unhein kya hukm diya tha. To unhon ne kaha ke maine unhein use khane ka hukm diya. To Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke agar tum unhein is ke ilawa hukm dete to main tumhare sath aisa karta, use dhamkate hue."
"783","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abu Huraira ko Abdullah bin Umar se bayan karte suna ke un ke paas se Rabaza mein muhrim qoum guzri to unhon ne un se shikar ke gosht ke bare mein fatwa manga jo unhon ne halal logon ko khate paya tha to unhon ne unhein use khane ka fatwa diya. Unhon ne kaha ke phir main Madina mein Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya aur un se is ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke tum ne unhein kya fatwa diya. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke maine unhein use khane ka fatwa diya. Unhon ne kaha ke Umar ne kaha ke agar tum unhein is ke ilawa fatwa dete to main tumhein dardnak saza deta."
"784","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke Kaab Ahbar Sham se sawaron ke garoh mein aae yahan tak ke jab wo raaste ke baaz hisse mein they to unhon ne shikar ka gosht paya to Kaab ne unhein use khane ka fatwa diya. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab wo Madina mein Umar bin Khattab ke paas aae to unhon ne un se is ka zikr kya to unhon ne kaha ke tumhein ye kis ne fatwa diya. Unhon ne kaha ke Kaab ne. Unhon ne kaha ke maine use tum par ameer banaya hai yahan tak ke tum lauto, phir jab wo Makka ke baaz raaste mein they to un ke paas se tidiyon ka aik mard guzra to Kaab ne unhein fatwa diya ke use pakdein aur khaein, phir jab wo Umar bin Khattab ke paas aae to unhon ne un se is ka zikr kya to unhon ne kaha ke tumhein is ka fatwa dene par kis ne ubhara. Unhon ne kaha ke wo samandari shikar mein se hai. Unhon ne kaha ke tumhein kya maloom. Unhon ne kaha ke aye Ameerul Momineen us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ye to machhli ki cheenk ke siwa kuchh nahi jo wo har saal do martaba chheenkta hai."
"785","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se, unhon ne Laithi Saab bin Jassama se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jangli gadha tohfe mein diya jabke Aap Abwa ya Waddan mein they to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use un par lautaya, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere chehre mein jo tha dekha to farmaya ke hum ne use tum par is ke siwa na lautaya ke hum hurmat wale hain."
"786","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Rabia ke bete Aamir ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Usman bin Affan ko Araj mein dekha jabke wo garmi ke din mein muhrim they, unhon ne apna chehra argawani qateefa se dhanpa hua tha, phir un ke paas shikar ka gosht laya gaya to unhon ne apne sathiyon se kaha ke khao. To unhon ne kaha ke kya aap khud na khaeinge. To unhon ne kaha ke main tum jaisa nahi hun, ye to mere liye shikar kya gaya hai."
"787","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne apne bhatije se kaha ke aye bhanje ye to das raatein hain, phir agar tumhare dil mein koi cheez khatke to use chhor do, yani shikar ka gosht khana. Malik ne kaha ke muhrim mard ke bare mein jis ke liye shikar kya jae phir wo shikar us ke liye pakaya jae aur wo is mein se khae jabke wo janta ho ke us ke liye shikar kya gaya hai to us par us tamam shikar ka badla hai. Aur Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo murdar khane par majboor ho jabke wo muhrim ho ke kya wo shikar kare aur use khae ya murdar khae. To unhon ne kaha ke balke murdar khae, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne muhrim ko shikar khane aur use pakadne ki kisi haal mein rukhsat na di aur murdar mein iztirar ki halat mein rukhsat di. Malik ne kaha ke jo shikar muhrim qatal kare ya zibah kare us ka khana halal ke liye aur na muhrim ke liye halal hai kyunke wo zaki nahi, chahe khata se ho ya amdan, to us ka khana halal nahi, aur maine ye aik se zyada se suna hai, aur jo shikar qatal kare phir use khae to us par aik hi kaffara hai us jaisa jis ne use qatal kya aur is mein se na khaya."
"788","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke janwaron mein se paanch hain ke muhrim par inhein qatal karne mein koi gunah nahi, kawwa aur cheel aur bichhu aur chuha aur katne wala kutta."
"789","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke janwaron mein se paanch hain ke jo inhein qatal kare jabke wo muhrim ho to us par koi gunah nahi, bichhu aur chuha aur kawwa aur cheel aur katne wala kutta."
"790","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke paanch fasiq hain jo Haram mein qatal kiye jaein, chuha aur bichhu aur kawwa aur cheel aur katne wala kutta."
"791","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Haram mein saanp qatal karne ka hukm diya. Malik ne kaha ke katne wale kutte ke bare mein jis ke Haram mein qatal karne ka hukm diya gaya ke har wo jo logon ko kaate aur un par hamla kare aur unhein darae jaise sher aur cheeta aur tendua aur bhediya to wo katne wala kutta hai, aur jo darindon mein se hamla na kare jaise lakadbaggha aur lomdi aur billi aur in jaisi darindon mein se hon to muhrim inhein qatal na kare, phir agar inhein qatal kare to fidya de, aur jo parindon mein se nuqsan de to muhrim use qatal na kare magar jin ka Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne naam liya kawwa aur cheel, aur agar muhrim in dono ke siwa parindon mein se koi cheez qatal kare to fidya de."
"792","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Haris Taimi ke bete Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne Hudair ke bete Abdullah ke bete Rabia se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ko dekha ke wo Suqya mein keechad mein apne oont ke juen chun rahe they jabke wo muhrim they. Malik ne kaha ke main ise makrooh samajhta hun."
"793","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Alqama ke bete Abi Alqama se, unhon ne apni walida se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ko muhrim ke bare mein puchte suna ke kya wo apna jism khujlae. To unhon ne kaha ke haan, use khujlae aur zor se khujlae, aur agar mere dono haath bandh diye jaein aur main apne paon ke siwa na paun to khujlaungi."
"794","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Musa ke bete Ayyub se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne aaine mein dekha apni aankh ki shikayat ke liye jabke wo muhrim they."
"795","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar makrooh samajhte they ke muhrim apne oont se chappar ya chichda utare. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi mujhe sab se pasand hai."
"796","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Maryam ke bete Abdullah ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se apne nakhun ke bare mein pucha jo toot gaya tha jabke wo muhrim they to Saeed ne kaha ke use kaat do. Aur Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo apne kaan ki shikayat kare ke kya wo apne kaan mein doodh tapkae jo khushbudaar na kya gaya ho jabke wo muhrim ho. To unhon ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi samajhta aur agar use apne munh mein dale to is mein koi harj nahi samajhta. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke muhrim apna phoda cheer de aur apni phinsi phod de aur apni rag kaat de jab use is ki haajat ho."
"797","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abbas ke bete Fadl Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhe sawaar they to Khasham ki aik aurat un se fatwa puchhne aayi to Fadl use dekhne lage aur wo unhein dekhne lagi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fadl ka chehra dusri taraf pherne lage. To us ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah hajj mein Allah ka farz mere walid ko budha paya hai jo sawari par jam kar nahi baith sakte, to kya main un ki taraf se hajj karun. Aap ne farmaya ke haan. Aur ye Hujjatul Wida mein tha."
"798","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hudaibiya mein halal hue, wo aur Aap ke sahaba, to unhon ne hadi zibah ki aur apne sar mundwae aur har cheez se halal hue is se pehle ke Baitullah ka tawaf karte aur is se pehle ke hadi un tak pahunche, phir maloom na hua ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaba mein se kisi ko ya jo un ke sath they unhein hukm diya ho ke koi cheez qaza karein aur na kisi cheez ki taraf lautein."
"799","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha jab wo fitne mein umra karte hue Makka ki taraf nikle ke agar main Baitullah se rok diya gaya to hum waisa kareinge jaisa hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath kya, to umre ka ehlal kya is liye ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hudaibiya ke saal umre ka ehlal kya tha, phir Abdullah ne apne muamle mein ghaur kya to kaha ke in dono ka muamla to aik hai, phir apne sahaba ki taraf mutawajjeh hue to kaha ke in dono ka muamla to aik hai, main tumhein gawah karta hun ke maine umre ke sath hajj wajib kar liya. Phir chalte rahe yahan tak ke Baitullah aae aur aik tawaf kya aur use apne liye kafi samjha aur hadi di."
"800","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo bimari se rok diya jae wo halal na ho yahan tak ke Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare, phir agar aise kapdon mein se koi cheez pehenne par majboor ho jin ke baghair use koi chara na ho ya dawai ki to aisa kare aur fidya de."
"801","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se khabar pahunchi ke wo kehti thin ke muhrim ko Baitullah ke siwa kuchh halal nahi karta."
"802","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Tamima ke bete Abi Tamima Ayyub se, unhon ne Basra walon mein se aik mard se jo qadeem tha riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Makka ki taraf nikla yahan tak ke jab raaste ke baaz hisse mein tha to meri raan toot gayi to maine Makka ki taraf paigham bheja jahan Abdullah bin Abbas aur Abdullah bin Umar aur log they to mujhe kisi ne halal hone ki rukhsat na di, to main us pani par saat mahine thehra yahan tak ke umre se halal hua."
"803","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo Baitullah se bimari ke sabab rok diya jae wo halal na ho yahan tak ke Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare."
"804","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Makhzumi Maabad bin Hazaba Makka ke baaz raaste mein gira diye gae jabke wo muhrim they to unhon ne us pani walon ke zimmedar se pucha jis par wo they to Abdullah bin Umar aur Abdullah bin Zubair aur Marwan bin Hakam ko paya aur un se jo unhein pesh aaya tha zikr kya to un sab ne use hukm diya ke jis se use koi chara na ho us se ilaj karae aur fidya de, phir jab sehatmand ho to umra kare aur apne ehram se halal ho, phir us par aane wale saal hajj hai aur jo hadi aasan ho. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek is par hukm yehi hai jo dushman ke ilawa se rok diya jae, aur Umar bin Khattab ne Ansari Abu Ayyub aur Hibar bin Aswad ko hukm diya tha jab un se hajj faut ho gaya aur wo Nahr ke din aae ke umre se halal hon phir halal hokar lautein phir aane wale saal hajj karein aur hadi dein, phir jo na paye to hajj mein teen din roza aur saat jab apne ghar walon ki taraf laute. Malik ne kaha ke har wo jo hajj se rok diya jae is ke baad ke wo ehram bandhe, chahe bimari se ya is ke ilawa se ya ginti ki ghalti se ya us par chand poshida rahe to wo muhsar hai us par wo hai jo muhsar par hai. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se us shakhs ke bare mein pucha gaya jo Makka walon mein se hajj ka ehlal kare phir use haddi tootna ya pet mein sozish ya talaaq dene wali aurat pesh aae. Unhon ne kaha ke jinhein ye pesh aae wo muhsar hain un par waisa hoga jaisa bahar walon par hota hai jab wo rok diye jaein. Malik ne kaha ke us mard ke bare mein jo hajj ke mahinon mein umra karte hue aaya yahan tak ke jab apna umra poora kar liya to Makka se hajj ka ehlal kya phir toot gaya ya use koi muamla pesh aaya jis se wo logon ke sath Mawqif mein hazir hone par qadir na ho. Malik ne kaha ke meri rai hai ke thehre yahan tak ke jab sehatmand ho to Hill ki taraf nikle phir Makka ki taraf laute aur Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare phir halal ho, phir us par aane wale saal hajj aur hadi hai. Malik ne kaha ke jo Makka se hajj ka ehlal kare phir Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare phir beemar ho aur logon ke sath Mawqif mein hazir hone ki taqat na rakhe. Malik ne kaha ke jab us se hajj faut ho jae to agar taqat rakhe to Hill ki taraf nikle aur umre ke sath dakhil ho phir Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare kyunke pehla tawaf us ne umre ki niyyat se na kya tha is liye is se amal kare, aur us par aane wale saal hajj aur hadi hai. Phir agar Makka walon ke ilawa mein se ho aur use bimari pesh aae jo us ke aur hajj ke darmiyan haail ho to Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare aur umre se halal ho, aur Baitullah ka dusra tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare kyunke us ka pehla tawaf aur sai us ne hajj ki niyyat se kya tha, aur us par aane wale saal hajj aur hadi hai."
"805","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se riwayat kya ke Abu Bakr Siddiq ke bete Abdullah bin Muhammad ne Abdullah bin Umar ko Aaisha se khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum ne na dekha ke tumhari qoum ne jab Kaaba banaya to Ibrahim ki bunyadon se kotahi ki. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah kya aap use Ibrahim ki bunyadon par na lautaein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumhari qoum ka kufr naya na hota to main aisa karta. Unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke agar Aaisha ne ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai to main nahi samajhta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hatim se lage hue do ruknon ka istilam chhora magar is liye ke Baitullah Ibrahim ki bunyadon par mukammal na kya gaya tha."
"806","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Momineen ki maan Aaisha ne kaha ke mujhe parwa nahi ke main Hatim mein namaz padhun ya Baitullah mein."
"807","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ko kehte suna ke maine hamare baaz ulema ko kehte suna ke Hatim ka hajr na kya gaya aur logon ne us ke peechhe se tawaf na kya magar is irade se ke log Baitullah ke tamam tawaf ko poora karein."
"808","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap Hajar-e-Aswad se ramal karte yahan tak ke us tak pahunche, teen pheron mein."
"809","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Hajar-e-Aswad se Hajar-e-Aswad tak teen pheron mein ramal karte aur chaar pheron mein chalte."
"810","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke un ke walid jab Baitullah ka tawaf karte to teen pheron mein daudte aur kehte ke aye Allah tere siwa koi mabood nahi aur tu zinda karta hai is ke baad ke tu ne maut di, is se apni aawaz past karte."
"811","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Zubair ko dekha ke unhon ne Taneem se umre ka ehram bandha. Unhon ne kaha ke phir maine unhein dekha ke wo Baitullah ke gird teen phere daud rahe they."
"812","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab Makka se ehram bandhte to Baitullah ka tawaf na karte aur na Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan yahan tak ke Mina se laute, aur jab Baitullah ke gird tawaf karte jab Makka se ehram bandhte to ramal na karte."
"813","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Baitullah ka tawaf poora karte aur do rakatein padhte aur Safa aur Marwa ki taraf nikalne ka irada karte to nikalne se pehle Hajar-e-Aswad ka istilam karte."
"814","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman se farmaya ke aye Abu Muhammad tum ne rukn ke istilam mein kya kya. To Abdur Rahman ne kaha ke maine istilam kya aur chhora. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke tum ne durust kya."
"815","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke un ke walid jab Baitullah ka tawaf karte to tamam arkan ka istilam karte aur Yamani ko na chhorte magar ke us par ghalba ho jae."
"816","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Baitullah ka tawaf karte hue Hajar-e-Aswad se kaha ke tu to pathar hai aur agar maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tujhe chumte na dekha hota to main tujhe na chumta, phir use chuma."
"817","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo do saaton ko jama na karte, in ke darmiyan namaz na padhte lekin har saat ke baad do rakatein padhte, phir kabhi Muqam ke paas ya is ke ilawa namaz padhte. Aur Malik se tawaf ke bare mein pucha gaya ke kya mard ke liye aasan ho ke nafil ke sath tawaf kare aur do ya zyada hafton ko jama kare phir un hafton ka jo ruku us par hai padhe. Unhon ne kaha ke aisa na karna chahiye, sunnat to yehi hai ke har saat ke peechhe do rakatein hon. Malik ne kaha ke us mard ke bare mein jo tawaf mein dakhil ho phir bhool jae yahan tak ke aath ya nau phere tawaf kare. Unhon ne kaha ke qata kare jab jane ke zyada kar liya phir do rakatein padhe aur jo zyada kya tha use shumar na kare aur us ke liye jaiz nahi ke nau par bina kare yahan tak ke dono saaton ko jama karke saat padhe kyunke tawaf mein sunnat ye hai ke har saat ke peechhe do rakatein hon. Malik ne kaha ke jo apne tawaf mein shak kare is ke baad ke wo tawaf ki do rakatein padh le to phir laute aur yaqeen par apna tawaf mukammal kare phir do rakatein dobara padhe kyunke saat mukammal kiye baghair tawaf ki namaz nahi. Aur jise koi cheez pesh aae jo us ke wuzu ko tode jabke wo Baitullah ka tawaf ya Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kar raha ho ya in ke darmiyan ho to jo aisa pesh aae aur us ne baaz tawaf ya tamam tawaf kar liya ho aur tawaf ki do rakatein na padhi hon to wuzu kare aur tawaf aur do rakatein naye sire se kare, aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai ka muamla ye hai ke use is par jo us ke wuzu tootne se pesh aae qata nahi karta aur sai mein dakhil na ho magar tahir hokar wuzu ke sath."
"818","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Humaid se riwayat kya ke Qari ke bete Abdur Rahman bin Abdul ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ke sath subah ki namaz ke baad Baitullah ka tawaf kya, phir jab Umar ne tawaf poora kya to dekha aur suraj tulu hua na paya to sawaar hue yahan tak ke Zu Tuwa mein oont bithaya aur do rakatein padhin."
"819","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Abu Zubair se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Abbas ko asr ki namaz ke baad tawaf karte dekha phir apni hujre mein dakhil hue to main nahi janta ke wo kya karte hain."
"820","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Abu Zubair se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Baitullah ko subah ki namaz ke baad aur asr ki namaz ke baad khali dekha ke koi us ka tawaf na karta tha. Malik ne kaha ke jo apne hafte ka baaz tawaf kare phir subah ki namaz ya asr ki namaz qaim ho jae to wo imam ke sath namaz padhe phir jo tawaf kya tha us par bina kare yahan tak ke saat mukammal kare phir namaz na padhe yahan tak ke suraj tulu ho ya ghurub ho. Unhon ne kaha ke agar in dono ko moakhir kare yahan tak ke maghrib padhe to is mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke mard subah ke baad aur asr ke baad aik tawaf kare, aik saat se zyada na kare aur do rakatein moakhir kare yahan tak ke suraj tulu ho jaisa Umar bin Khattab ne kya, aur in dono ko asr ke baad moakhir kare yahan tak ke suraj ghurub ho, phir jab suraj ghurub ho to inhein padhe agar chahe aur agar chahe to inhein moakhir kare yahan tak ke maghrib padhe, is mein koi harj nahi."
"821","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke hajiyon mein se koi na laute yahan tak ke Baitullah ka tawaf kare kyunke aakhri nusuk Baitullah ka tawaf hai. Malik ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab ke qaul ke bare mein ke aakhri nusuk Baitullah ka tawaf hai ke ye hamare khayal mein, wallahu alam, Allah Tabarak wa Taala ke qaul ke liye hai ke jo Allah ki nishaniyon ki taazeem kare to ye dilon ke taqwe se hai, aur farmaya ke phir in ka thikana Baitullah Ateeq tak hai, to tamam nishaniyon ka thikana aur in ka khatm Baitullah Ateeq tak hai."
"822","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Marr Zahran se aik mard ko lautaya jo Baitullah ko alwida na keh saka tha yahan tak ke us ne alwida kaha."
"823","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo ifaza kare us ka Allah ne hajj poora kar diya, phir agar use koi cheez na roke to wo is ka haqdar hai ke us ka aakhri ahad Baitullah ka tawaf ho, aur agar use koi cheez roke ya aariz ho to Allah ne us ka hajj poora kar diya. Malik ne kaha ke agar koi mard jahil ho ke us ka aakhri ahad Baitullah ka tawaf ho yahan tak ke rawana ho jae to main us par koi cheez nahi samajhta magar ke qareeb ho to laute aur Baitullah ka tawaf kare phir munsarif ho jab wo ifaza kar chuka ho."
"824","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Naufal ke bete Abdul Rahman ke bete Muhammad Abu Aswad se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Salma ki beti Zainab se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se shikayat ki ke main beemar hun to Aap ne farmaya ke logon ke peechhe se tawaf karo jabke tum sawaar ho. Unhon ne kaha ke maine apne oont par sawaar hokar tawaf kya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt Baitullah ke pehlu mein namaz padh rahe they aur Toor aur kitab-e-mastoor padh rahe they."
"825","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Abu Zubair se riwayat kya ke Aslami Abu Maiz Sufyan ke bete Abdullah ne unhein khabar di ke wo Abdullah bin Umar ke paas baithe they to un ke paas aik aurat aayi jo un se fatwa puchhti thi to us ne kaha ke main Baitullah ka tawaf karne ka irada karke aayi yahan tak ke jab masjid ke darwaze par thi to khoon behne lage, to main laut gayi yahan tak ke wo mujh se jata raha, phir aayi yahan tak ke jab masjid ke darwaze par thi to khoon behne lage. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke ye to shaitan ki thokar hai, ghusl karo phir kapde se patti bandho phir tawaf karo."
"826","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Waqqas ke bete Saad jab Makka mein dakhil hote to taang waqt mein Arafa ki taraf nikalte is se pehle ke Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai karte, phir lautne ke baad tawaf karte. Malik ne kaha ke ye wasee hai insha Allah. Aur Malik se pucha gaya ke kya mard Baitullah ke wajib tawaf mein khada ho kar mard se baat kare. To unhon ne kaha ke main us ke liye ise pasand nahi karta. Malik ne kaha ke koi Baitullah ka tawaf na kare aur na Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan magar tahir hokar."
"827","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ali ke bete Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna jab Aap masjid se Safa ka irada karke nikle jabke Aap kehte they ke hum us se shuru karte hain jis se Allah ne shuru kya. To Safa se shuru kya."
"828","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ali ke bete Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Safa par theherte to teen martaba takbeer kehte aur kehte ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wahda hu la shareeka lah, us ke liye badshahi hai aur us ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai. Aisa teen martaba karte aur dua karte aur Marwa par is jaisa karte."
"829","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar ko Safa par dua karte suna jo kehte they ke aye Allah beshak tu ne kaha ke mujhe pukaro main tumhein jawab dunga aur beshak tu wada khilafi nahi karta, aur main tujh se sawal karta hun jaisa tu ne mujhe Islam ki hidayat di ke use mujh se na chheen yahan tak ke mujhe wafat de jabke main musalman hun."
"830","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Momineen ki maan Aaisha se kaha jabke main us din kam umr tha ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ke qaul ke bare mein kya kehte hain ke beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain to jo Baitullah ka hajj ya umra kare to us par koi gunah nahi ke in dono ka tawaf kare, to mard par kuchh nahi ke in dono ka tawaf na kare. To Aaisha ne kaha ke hargiz nahi, agar jaisa tum kehte ho hota to hota ke us par koi gunah nahi ke in dono ka tawaf na kare, ye aayat to Ansar ke bare mein utri jo Manat ke liye ehlal karte they aur Manat Qudaid ke samne thi aur wo Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf karne se parhez karte they, phir jab Islam aaya to unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is ke bare mein pucha to Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne nazil kya ke beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain to jo Baitullah ka hajj ya umra kare to us par koi gunah nahi ke in dono ka tawaf kare."
"831","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke Umar ke bete Abdullah ki beti Sauda Zubair ke bete Urwa ke nikah mein thin to wo Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan hajj ya umre mein paidal tawaf karne niklin jabke wo bhari badan wali aurat thin, to wo aayin jab log isha se munsarif hue they phir apna tawaf poora na kar sakin yahan tak ke subah ki pehli azaan di gayi to unhon ne apna tawaf is ke darmiyan poora kya. Aur Urwa jab unhein sawariyon par tawaf karte dekhte to sakht mana karte to wo haya se bimari ka uzr karte to wo hum se kehte humare darmiyan ke ye naakam hue aur khasare mein rahe. Malik ne kaha ke jo Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai bhool jae umre mein aur yaad na kare yahan tak ke Makka se door ho jae ke wo laute aur sai kare, aur agar auraton ko pahunch chuka ho to laute aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare yahan tak ke us umre ka jo baqi reh gaya use mukammal kare phir us par dusra umra aur hadi hai. Aur Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jise mard Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan mile aur us ke sath khada hokar baat kare. To unhon ne kaha ke main us ke liye ise pasand nahi karta. Malik ne kaha ke jo apne tawaf mein se kuchh bhoole ya is mein shak kare aur yaad na kare magar jabke wo Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kar raha ho to apni sai qata kare phir jo yaqeen kare us par Baitullah ka tawaf mukammal kare aur tawaf ki do rakatein padhe phir Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai naye sire se shuru kare."
"832","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Safa se utarte to chalte yahan tak ke jab Aap ke dono qadam wadi ke nasheb mein dhanste to daudte yahan tak ke is se nikalte."
"833","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke azad karda Abu Nadr se, unhon ne Abbas ke bete Abdullah ke azad karda Umair se, unhon ne Haris ki beti Umm Fadl se riwayat kya ke logon ne un ke paas Arafa ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke roze mein jhagda kya to baaz ne kaha ke wo rozedar hain aur baaz ne kaha ke rozedar nahi hain, to unhon ne Aap ki taraf doodh ka pyala bheja jabke Aap apne oont par khade they to Aap ne piya."
"834","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim se riwayat kya ke Momineen ki maan Aaisha Arafa ke din roza rakhti thin. Qasim ne kaha ke maine unhein Arafa ki shaam dekha ke imam hate phir theharti thin yahan tak ke un ke aur logon ke darmiyan zameen se jo tha safed ho jata phir sharbat mangwatin aur iftar kartin."
"835","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke azad karda Abu Nadr se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mina ke dinon ke roze se mana kya."
"836","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mina ke dinon mein Huzafa ke bete Abdullah ko bheja jo tawaf karke kehte ke ye to khane peene aur Allah ke zikr ke din hain."
"837","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Habban ke bete Muhammad bin Yahya se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do dinon ke roze se mana kya, Fitr ke din aur Azha ke din."
"838","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hadi ke bete Yazeed bin Abdullah se, unhon ne Aqil bin Abi Talib ki behn Umm Hani ke azad karda Abu Murra se, unhon ne Aas ke bete Amr ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke wo apne walid Aas ke bete Amr ke paas dakhil hue to unhein khate paya. Unhon ne kaha ke unhon ne mujhe bulaya. Unhon ne kaha ke maine un se kaha ke main rozedar hun. To unhon ne kaha ke ye wo din hain jin se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein roze se mana kya aur hamein iftar ka hukm diya."
"839","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik oont hadi kya jo Hisham ke bete Abu Jahl ka tha hajj ya umre mein."
"840","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik mard ko badna hankte dekha to farmaya ke is par sawaar ho. To us ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ye to badna hai. To farmaya ke is par sawaar ho, tere liye kharabi ho, dusri ya teesri martaba mein."
"841","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke wo Abdullah bin Umar ko dekhte they ke wo hajj mein do do badne hadi karte aur umre mein aik aik badna. Unhon ne kaha ke maine unhein umre mein badna zibah karte dekha jabke wo Asid ke bete Khalid ke ghar mein khadi thi aur wahan un ka thikana tha. Unhon ne kaha ke maine unhein dekha ke unhon ne apni badna ki kokh mein neza mara yahan tak ke neza us ke kandhe ke neeche se nikla."
"842","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne hajj ya umre mein oont hadi kya."
"843","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Qari Abu Jafar se riwayat kya ke Makhzumi Rabi ke bete Abi Rabi ke bete Abdullah bin Ayyash ne do badne hadi kin jin mein se aik Bukhti thi."
"844","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jab oontni bacha jane to us ke bache ko uthaya jae yahan tak ke us ke sath zibah kya jae, phir agar us ke liye sawari na pai jae to us ki maan par uthaya jae yahan tak ke us ke sath zibah kya jae."
"845","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke un ke walid ne kaha ke jab apni badna se majboor ho jao to is par sawaar ho aisi sawari jo bojhal na ho, aur jab us ke doodh se majboor ho jao to piyo is ke baad ke us ka bacha ser ho jae, phir jab use zibah karo to us ke bache ko us ke sath zibah karo."
"846","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo jab Madina se hadi bhejte to Zul Hulaifa mein use haar pehnate aur ishara karte, use haar pehnate is se pehle ke use ishara karte aur ye aik hi jagah mein hota jabke wo Qibla ki taraf mutawajjeh hote, use do jootiyon se haar pehnate aur use baein pehlu se ishara karte, phir use sath hankte yahan tak ke use Arafa mein logon ke sath thehrate phir use un ke sath hate jab wo hatte, phir jab Mina aate Nahr ki subah use zibah karte is se pehle ke sar mundein ya qasar karein, aur wo khud apni hadi zibah karte apne haath se, inhein khada qatar mein karte aur inhein Qibla ki taraf mutawajjeh karte phir khate aur khilate."
"847","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab apni hadi ki kokh mein chubhote jab use ishara karte to kehte ke Bismillah wallahu akbar."
"848","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke hadi wo hai jise haar pehnaya jae aur ishara kya jae aur use Arafa mein thehraya jae."
"849","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar apni badnon ko Qibati aur Namati aur Hullah kapde pehnate phir inhein Kaaba ki taraf bhejte aur use inhein pehnate."
"850","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se pucha ke Abdullah bin Umar apni badnon ke jhoolon ka kya karte they jab Kaaba ko ye libas pehnaya gaya. Unhon ne kaha ke wo use sadqa kar dete they."
"851","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar qurbaniyon aur badnon ke bare mein kehte they ke sani aur is se upar ho."
"852","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar apni badnon ke jhool na cheerte they aur na inhein jhool pehnate they yahan tak ke Mina se Arafa ki taraf subah jate."
"853","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo apne beton se kehte they ke aye beton tum mein se koi badnon mein se koi cheez hadi na kare jise wo apne kareem ko hadi karte sharmaye kyunke Allah sab se zyada kareem hai aur zyada haqdar hai ke us ke liye muntakhab kya jae."
"854","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadi wale ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah main hadi mein se jo toot phoot jae us se kya karun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke hadi mein se har badna jo toot jae use zibah kar phir us ka haar us ke khoon mein daal phir use aur logon ko chhor de ke use khaein."
"855","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo nafil badna hanke phir toot jae aur use zibah kare phir use aur logon ko chhor de ke use khaein to us par kuchh nahi, aur agar is mein se khae ya hukm de ke is mein se khaya jae to us ka badla de."
"856","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dili Saur bin Zaid se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se is jaisa riwayat kya."
"857","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo jaza ya nazr ya tamattu ki hadi ke taur par badna hadi kare aur raaste mein use musibat pahunche to us par badal hai."
"858","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo badna hadi kare phir gum ho jae ya mar jae to agar nazr ho to use badle aur agar nafil ho to agar chahe badle aur agar chahe chhor de. Aur mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne ahl-e-ilm ko kehte suna ke hadi wala jaza aur nusuk mein se na khae."
"859","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab aur Ali bin Abi Talib aur Abu Huraira se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo apni biwi ko pahunche jabke wo hajj se muhrim ho. To unhon ne kaha ke wo dono chalte rahein apne chehre par yahan tak ke apna hajj poora karein phir in dono par aane wale saal hajj aur hadi hai. Unhon ne kaha ke Ali bin Abi Talib ne kaha ke jab wo aane wale saal se hajj ka ehlal karein to juda ho jaein yahan tak ke apna hajj poora karein."
"860","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke tum us mard ke bare mein kya kehte ho jo apni biwi se sohbat kare jabke wo muhrim ho. To qoum ne un se kuchh na kaha. To Saeed ne kaha ke aik mard ne apni biwi se sohbat ki jabke wo muhrim tha to Madina ki taraf paigham bheja ke is ke bare mein pucha jae to baaz logon ne kaha ke in dono ke darmiyan aane wale saal tak judai karai jae. To Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha ke wo dono apne chehre par chalte rahein aur apna hajj jo unhon ne fasid kya poora karein, phir jab farigh hon to lautein, phir agar inhein aane wale saal hajj pa le to in dono par hajj aur hadi hai aur ehlal karein jahan se inhon ne apne us hajj ka ehlal kya tha jo unhon ne fasid kya tha. Aur juda ho jaein yahan tak ke apna hajj poora karein. Malik ne kaha ke wo dono aik aik badna hadi karein. Malik ne kaha ke us mard ke bare mein jo hajj mein apni biwi se sohbat kare is ke darmiyan ke wo Arafa se hate aur jamra ko rami kare ke us par hadi aur aane wale saal hajj wajib hai. Unhon ne kaha ke phir agar us ka apni biwi ko pahunchna jamra ki rami ke baad ho to us par hai ke umra kare aur hadi de aur us par aane wale saal hajj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jo hajj ya umra fasid kare yahan tak ke us par is mein hadi wajib ho hajj ya umre mein wo dono sharmgahon ka milna hai agarche pani na nikle. Unhon ne kaha ke ye bhi wajib karta hai pani ka nikalna jab chhune se ho, aur jo mard koi cheez yaad kare yahan tak ke is mein se pani nikle to main us par kuchh nahi samajhta, aur agar koi mard apni biwi ko bosa de aur is mein se pani na nikle to qible mein us par hadi ke siwa kuchh nahi, aur us aurat par jise us ka shohar pahunche jabke wo muhrima ho baar baar hajj ya umre mein jabke wo us mein us ki muti ho hadi ke siwa kuchh nahi aur aane wale saal hajj agar use hajj mein pahunche, aur agar use umre mein pahuncha ho to us par hai ke us umre ki qaza kare jo us ne fasid ki aur hadi."
"861","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Yasar ke bete Sulaiman ne khabar di ke Ansari Abu Ayyub hajj ke liye nikle yahan tak ke jab Makka ke raaste Naziya mein they to un ki sawar oontniyan gum ho gain aur wo Nahr ke din Umar bin Khattab ke paas aae aur un se is ka zikr kya to Umar ne kaha ke waisa karo jaisa motamir karta hai phir tum halal ho gae, phir jab tumhein aane wale saal hajj pa le to hajj karo aur jo hadi aasan ho do."
"862","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Hibar bin Aswad Nahr ke din aae jabke Umar bin Khattab apni hadi zibah kar rahe they to unhon ne kaha ke aye Ameerul Momineen hum ginti mein ghalti kha gae, hum samajhte they ke ye din Arafa ka din hai. To Umar ne kaha ke Makka ki taraf jao aur tawaf karo tum aur jo tumhare sath hon, aur hadi zibah karo agar tumhare sath ho, phir sar mundeo ya qasar karo aur lauto, phir jab aane wala saal ho to hajj karo aur hadi do, phir jo na paye to hajj mein teen din roza aur saat jab laute. Malik ne kaha ke jo hajj aur umre ko jama kare phir us se hajj faut ho jae to us par hai ke aane wale saal hajj kare aur hajj aur umre ko jama kare aur do hadiyan de, aik hadi apne hajj ko umre ke sath jama karne ke liye aur aik hadi apne us hajj ke liye jo us se faut hua."
"863","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Makki Abu Zubair se, unhon ne Rabah ke bete Ata bin Abi Rabah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke un se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo apni biwi se sohbat kare jabke wo Mina mein ho is se pehle ke ifaza kare. To unhon ne use hukm diya ke badna zibah kare."
"864","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dili Saur bin Zaid se, unhon ne Abbas ke bete Ibn Abbas ke azad karda Ikrima se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main nahi samajhta magar ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo apni biwi ko is se pehle pahunche ke ifaza kare wo umra kare aur hadi de."
"865","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Rabia ko is mein Ikrima ke qaul jaisa Ibn Abbas se kehte suna. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi mujhe sab se pasand hai. Aur Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo ifaza bhool jae yahan tak ke Makka se nikle aur apne shehar ki taraf laute. To unhon ne kaha ke meri rai hai ke agar us ne auraton ko na pahuncha ho to laute aur ifaza kare, aur agar auraton ko pahunch chuka ho to laute aur ifaza kare phir umra kare aur hadi de, aur us ke liye jaiz nahi ke apni hadi Makka se khareede aur use wahan zibah kare lekin agar use apne sath jahan se us ne umra kya tha na hank kar laya ho to use Makka mein khareede phir use Hill ki taraf nikale phir use wahan se Makka ki taraf hanke phir use wahan zibah kare."
"866","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jo hadi aasan ho wo bakri hai."
"867","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Abbas kehte they ke jo hadi aasan ho wo bakri hai. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi mujhe sab se pasand hai kyunke Allah Tabarak wa Taala apni kitab mein kehte hain ke aye iman walo shikar na qatal karo jabke tum hurmat wale ho aur jo tum mein se use amdan qatal kare to badla us jaisa hai jo us ne maweshiyon mein se qatal kya, tum mein se do adil faisla karein, hadi jo Kaaba tak pahunche ya kaffara miskeenon ka khana ya is ke barabar roza, to jis mein hadi ka faisla kya jae bakri hai aur Allah ne use hadi naam diya hai aur ye wo hai jis mein hamare nazdeek koi ikhtilaf nahi, aur is mein koi kaise shak kare jabke har cheez jo is tak na pahunche ke is mein oont ya gaye ka faisla kya jae to is mein faisla bakri hai, aur jo is tak na pahunche ke is mein bakri ka faisla kya jae to wo roze ya miskeenon ko khilane se kaffara hai."
"868","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jo hadi aasan ho wo badna ya gaye hai."
"869","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra ki azad karda jise Ruqayya kaha jata hai ne unhein khabar di ke wo Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra ke sath Makka ki taraf niklin. Unhon ne kaha ke Amra Tarwiya ke din Makka mein dakhil huin jabke main un ke sath thi, phir unhon ne Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kya phir masjid ke sehan mein dakhil huin aur kaha ke kya tumhare paas qainchi hai. To maine kaha ke nahi. To unhon ne kaha ke use mere liye talash karo. To maine use talash kya yahan tak ke use lekar aayi to unhon ne apne sar ki laton mein se liya, phir jab Nahr ka din tha to unhon ne bakri zibah ki."
"870","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Makki Yasar ke bete Sadaqa se riwayat kya ke Yaman walon mein se aik mard Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aaya jabke us ne apna sar gundha hua tha to us ne kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman main mufrad umre ke sath aaya hun. To Abdullah bin Umar ne us se kaha ke agar tum mere sath hote ya mujh se puchte to main tumhein hukm deta ke jama karo. To Yamani ne kaha ke ye ho chuka. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke jo tumhare sar se ude use lo aur hadi do. To Iraq walon mein se aik aurat ne kaha ke us ki hadi kya hai aye Abu Abdur Rahman. To unhon ne kaha ke us ki hadi. To us ne un se kaha ke us ki hadi kya hai. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke agar main bakri zibah karne ke siwa na paun to ye mujhe is se zyada pasand hai ke main roza rakhun."
"871","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke muhrim aurat jab halal ho to kanghi na kare yahan tak ke apne sar ki laton mein se le, aur agar us ke paas hadi ho to apne baalon mein se kuchh na le yahan tak ke apni hadi zibah kare. Aur mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne baaz ahl-e-ilm ko kehte suna ke mard aur us ki biwi aik badna mein shareek na hon, har aik aik aik badna hadi kare. Aur Malik se us shakhs ke bare mein pucha gaya jo apne sath hadi bhejta hai ke use hajj mein zibah kare jabke wo umre ka ehlal kiye hue hai ke kya use zibah kare jab halal ho ya use moakhir kare yahan tak ke use hajj mein zibah kare aur wo khud apne umre se halal ho. To unhon ne kaha ke balke use moakhir kare yahan tak ke use hajj mein zibah kare aur wo khud apne umre se halal ho. Malik ne kaha ke jis par shikar qatal karne mein hadi ka faisla kya jae ya us par is ke ilawa mein hadi wajib ho to us ki hadi Makka ke siwa na hogi jaisa Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke hadi jo Kaaba tak pahunche, aur jo hadi ke badle roze ya sadqe se ho to wo Makka ke ilawa mein hoga jahan hadi wala chahe ke kare use kare."
"872","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Makhzumi Khalid ke bete Yaqoob se, unhon ne Jafar ke bete Abdullah ke azad karda Abu Asma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke wo Jafar ke bete Abdullah ke sath they to un ke sath Madina se nikle aur Husain bin Ali par guzre jabke wo Suqya mein beemar they to Abdullah bin Jafar un par thehre yahan tak ke jab faut hone se dare to nikle aur Ali bin Abi Talib aur Umais ki beti Asma ki taraf bheja jabke wo dono Madina mein they to wo dono us ke paas aae, phir Husain ne apne sar ki taraf ishara kya to Ali ne us ke sar ke bare mein hukm diya to mundwaya gaya phir us ki taraf se Suqya mein nusuk kya aur us ki taraf se oont zibah kya. Yahya bin Saeed ne kaha ke Husain Usman bin Affan ke sath un ke us safar mein Makka ki taraf nikle they."
"873","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Arafa tamam mawqif hai aur Uran ke pet se unche raho, aur Muzdalifa tamam mawqif hai aur Muhassir ke pet se unche raho."
"874","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jan lo ke Arafa tamam mawqif hai siwae Uran ke pet ke aur Muzdalifa tamam mawqif hai siwae Muhassir ke pet ke. Malik ne kaha ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke hajj mein na behayai aur na fisq aur na jhagda. Unhon ne kaha ke rafas auraton ko pahunchna hai, wallahu alam. Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke roze ki raat tumhare liye apni auraton ki taraf rafas halal kya gaya. Unhon ne kaha ke fusooq buton ke liye zibah karna hai, wallahu alam. Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke ya fisq jis par ghairullah ka naam liya gaya ho. Unhon ne kaha ke hajj mein jhagda ye hai ke Quraish Mashar Haram ke paas Muzdalifa mein Quzah par theherte they aur Arab aur un ke ilawa Arafa mein theherte they to wo jhagadte they, ye kehte ke hum zyada durust hain aur ye kehte ke hum zyada durust hain, to Allah Taala ne farmaya ke har ummat ke liye hum ne ibadat muqarrar ki jis ki wo ibadat karte hain to wo aap se muamle mein jhagda na karein aur apne Rab ki taraf bulao beshak aap seedhi hidayat par hain, to ye jhagda hamare khayal mein, wallahu alam, aur maine ye ahl-e-ilm se suna hai."
"875","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jo Muzdalifa ki raat se Fajr tulu hone se pehle Arafa mein wuqoof na kare us ka hajj faut ho gaya, aur jo Muzdalifa ki raat se Fajr tulu hone se pehle Arafa mein wuqoof kare us ne hajj pa liya."
"876","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jise Muzdalifa ki raat se Fajr pa le aur us ne Arafa mein wuqoof na kya ho us ka hajj faut ho gaya, aur jo Muzdalifa ki raat se Fajr tulu hone se pehle Arafa mein wuqoof kare us ne hajj pa liya. Malik ne kaha ke ghulam ke bare mein jo Arafa ke Mawqif mein azad kya jae ke ye us ke liye hajjatul Islam se kafi nahi magar ke wo ehram na bandhe ho to ehram bandhe is ke baad ke azad ho phir usi raat Fajr tulu hone se pehle Arafa mein wuqoof kare, phir agar aisa kare to us ke liye kafi hoga, aur agar ehram na bandhe yahan tak ke Fajr tulu ho jae to us jaisa hoga jis ka hajj faut ho gaya jab wo Muzdalifa ki raat se Fajr tulu hone se pehle Arafa mein wuqoof na pa sake, aur ghulam par hajjatul Islam hogi use qaza kare."
"877","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Umar ke bete Abdullah ke bete Salim aur Ubaidullah se riwayat kya ke un ke walid Abdullah bin Umar apne ghar walon aur bachon ko Muzdalifa se Mina ki taraf aage bhejte yahan tak ke Mina mein subah padhte aur logon ke aane se pehle rami karte."
"878","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Rabah ke bete Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat kya ke Abu Bakr ki beti Asma ki azad karda ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Abu Bakr ki beti Asma ke sath Mina se andhere mein aaein. Unhon ne kaha ke maine un se kaha ke hum Mina se andhere mein aae hain. To unhon ne kaha ke hum us se behtar ke sath aisa karte they."
"879","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Talha bin Ubaidullah apni auraton aur bachon ko Muzdalifa se Mina ki taraf aage bhejte they. Aur mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne baaz ahl-e-ilm ko suna ke jamra ki rami ko makrooh samajhte hain yahan tak ke Nahr ke din Fajr tulu ho, aur jo rami kare to us ke liye nahr halal ho gaya."
"880","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne Munzir ki beti Fatima se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke wo Abu Bakr ki beti Asma ko Muzdalifa mein dekhtin ke wo us shakhs ko hukm detin jo un ke liye aur un ke sathiyon ke liye subah padhta ke un ke liye subah padhe jab Fajr tulu ho phir sawaar ho aur Mina ki taraf chalein aur wuqoof na karein."
"881","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Zaid ke bete Usama se pucha gaya jabke main un ke paas baitha tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hujjatul Wida mein jab hate to kaise chalte they. Unhon ne kaha ke Aap Unuq chalte phir jab khula maidan pate to Nass chalte. Malik ne kaha ke Hisham ne kaha ke Nass Unuq se upar hai."
"882","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Muhassir ke pet mein apni oontni ko pathar phenkne ke qadr tez chalate."
"883","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mina mein farmaya ke ye qurbangah hai aur tamam Mina qurbangah hai. Aur umre mein farmaya ke ye qurbangah hai, yani Marwa, aur Makka ki tamam ghatiyan aur raaste qurbangah hain."
"884","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra ne khabar di ke unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha ko kehte suna ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Zul Qaada se paanch raatein baqi hokar nikle aur hum hajj ke siwa kuchh na samajhte they, phir jab hum Makka ke qareeb hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jis ke sath hadi na thi use hukm diya ke jab Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare to halal ho jae. Aaisha ne kaha ke hum par Nahr ke din gaye ka gosht dakhil hua to maine kaha ke ye kya hai. To unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ki taraf se nahr kya. Yahya bin Saeed ne kaha ke maine ye hadis Muhammad ke bete Qasim se zikr ki to unhon ne kaha ke us ne tum tak hadis us ke chehre par pahunchayi."
"885","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Hafsa se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke logon ka kya haal hai ke halal ho gae aur aap apne umre se halal na hue. To Aap ne farmaya ke maine apna sar jamaya hai aur apni hadi ko haar pehnaya hai to halal na hunga yahan tak ke nahr karun."
"886","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni baaz hadi zibah ki aur Aap ke ilawa ne baaz zibah ki."
"887","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke jo badna ki nazr mane to use do jootiyon se haar pehnae aur ishara kare phir use Baitullah ke paas ya Mina mein Nahr ke din zibah kare, is ka thikana is se kam nahi, aur jo oonton ya gayon mein se jazoor ki nazr mane to use jahan chahe zibah kare."
"888","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke un ke walid apni badne khada karke zibah karte they. Malik ne kaha ke kisi ke liye jaiz nahi ke apna sar munde yahan tak ke apni hadi zibah kare, aur kisi ke liye jaiz nahi ke Nahr ke din Fajr se pehle zibah kare, amal to tamam Nahr ke din hai, zibah aur kapde pehenna aur mail door karna aur halq, in mein se koi cheez Nahr ke din se pehle na ki jae."
"889","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aye Allah mundwane walon par rehem kar. Unhon ne kaha ke aur qasar karne walon par ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke aye Allah mundwane walon par rehem kar. Unhon ne kaha ke aur qasar karne walon par ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke aur qasar karne walon par."
"890","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo Makka mein raat ko dakhil hote jabke wo umre ke sath hote aur Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai karte aur halq ko moakhir karte yahan tak ke subah hoti. Unhon ne kaha ke lekin wo Baitullah ki taraf na lautein aur us ka tawaf na karein yahan tak ke apna sar mundein. Unhon ne kaha ke kabhi masjid mein dakhil hote aur is mein witr padhte aur Baitullah ke qareeb na jate. Malik ne kaha ke tafas sar ke baal mundwana aur kapde pehenna hai aur jo is ke tabe hai. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo Mina mein hajj mein halq bhool jae ke kya us ke liye rukhsat hai ke Makka mein halq kare. Unhon ne kaha ke ye wasee hai aur Mina mein halq mujhe zyada pasand hai. Malik ne kaha ke wo hukm jis mein hamare nazdeek koi ikhtilaf nahi ke koi apna sar na munde aur na apne baalon mein se le yahan tak ke hadi zibah kare agar us ke sath ho, aur kisi cheez se halal na ho jo us par haram hui yahan tak ke Mina mein Nahr ke din halal ho, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke apne saron ko na mundeo yahan tak ke hadi apne thikane tak pahunche."
"891","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab Ramzan se iftar karte jabke wo hajj ka irada rakhte to apne sar aur dadhi mein se kuchh na lete yahan tak ke hajj karte. Malik ne kaha ke ye logon par nahi."
"892","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab hajj ya umre mein halq karte to apni dadhi aur muchhon mein se lete."
"893","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Rabia se riwayat kya ke aik mard Muhammad ke bete Qasim ke paas aaya aur kaha ke maine ifaza kya aur mere sath meri biwi ne ifaza kya phir main ghati ki taraf hata aur apni biwi ke qareeb hone ka irada kya to us ne kaha ke maine abhi apne baalon mein se qasar nahi kya to maine us ke baalon mein se apne danton se liya phir us se sohbat ki to Qasim hanse aur kaha ke use hukm do ke apne baalon mein se qainchi se le. Malik ne kaha ke is jaisa mein khoon bahana mustahab samajhta hun aur is ki wajah ye hai ke Abdullah bin Abbas ne kaha ke jo apne nusuk mein se koi cheez bhoole to khoon bahae."
"894","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo apne ghar walon mein se Mujabbar naami aik mard se mile jo ifaza kar chuka tha aur us ne halq na kya tha aur na qasar, is se jahil tha, to Abdullah ne use hukm diya ke laute aur halq ya qasar kare phir Baitullah ki taraf laute aur ifaza kare."
"895","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Abdullah ke bete Salim jab ehram bandhne ka irada karte to qainchi mangwate aur apni muchhein qatarte aur apni dadhi mein se lete is se pehle ke sawaar hon aur is se pehle ke muhrim hokar ehlal karein."
"896","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo apna sar gundhe wo halq kare aur talbeed se mushabihat na karo."
"897","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo apna sar jode ya gundhe ya jamaye us par halq wajib ho gaya."
"898","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kaaba mein dakhil hue, Aap aur Zaid ke bete Usama aur Rabah ke bete Bilal aur Talha Hajbi ke bete Usman, to use apne upar band kar liya aur is mein thehre. Abdullah ne kaha ke maine Bilal se pucha jab wo nikle ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya kya. To unhon ne kaha ke unhon ne aik sutun apne daein aur do sutun apne baein aur teen sutun apne peechhe kiye, aur Baitullah us din chhe sutunon par tha, phir namaz padhi."
"899","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Marwan ke bete Abdul Malik ne Yusuf ke bete Hajjaj ko likha ke Abdullah bin Umar se hajj ke kisi muamle mein mukhalifat na karo. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab Arafa ka din tha to Abdullah bin Umar us ke paas aae jab suraj dhal gaya jabke main un ke sath tha to unhon ne us ke kheme ke paas use pukara ke ye kahan hai. To Hajjaj us ke paas nikla jabke us par usfur se ranga tehband tha to us ne kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman tumhein kya hai. To unhon ne kaha ke rawangi agar tum sunnat chahte ho. To us ne kaha ke kya isi ghadi. Unhon ne kaha ke haan. Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe mohlat do yahan tak ke pani par ghusl karun phir niklun. To Abdullah utre yahan tak ke Hajjaj nikla aur mere aur mere walid ke darmiyan chala to maine us se kaha ke agar tum aaj sunnat ko pahunchna chahte ho to khutba mukhtasar karo aur namaz jaldi padho. Unhon ne kaha ke wo Abdullah bin Umar ki taraf dekhne laga taake ye us se sune, phir jab Abdullah ne ye dekha to kaha ke Salim ne sach kaha."
"900","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Mina mein Zuhr aur Asr aur Maghrib aur Isha aur Subah padhte phir subah jate jab suraj tulu hota Arafa ki taraf. Malik ne kaha ke wo hukm jis mein hamare nazdeek koi ikhtilaf nahi ke imam Arafa ke din Zuhr mein qirat buland na kare aur ke wo Arafa ke din logon ko khutba de aur ke Arafa ke din namaz Zuhr hi hai agarche Juma ko muwafiq ho, ye to Zuhr hi hai lekin safar ki wajah se qasar ki gayi. Malik ne kaha ke hajiyon ke imam ke bare mein jab Juma ka din Arafa ke din ya Nahr ke din ya Tashreeq ke baaz dinon ko muwafiq ho ke wo in dinon mein se kisi mein jama na kare."
"901","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzdalifa mein Maghrib aur Isha dono ko jama karke padha."
"902","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Musa bin Uqba se, unhon ne Abbas ke bete Ibn Abbas ke azad karda Kuraib se, unhon ne Zaid ke bete Usama se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Arafa se hate yahan tak ke jab ghati mein they to utre aur peshab kya phir wuzu kya aur mukammal wuzu na kya to maine un se kaha ke namaz ya Rasulullah. To Aap ne farmaya ke namaz aage hai. Phir sawaar hue, phir jab Muzdalifa aae to utre aur wuzu kya aur mukammal wuzu kya phir namaz qaim ki gayi aur Maghrib padhi, phir har insan ne apna oont apne thikane mein bithaya phir Isha qaim ki gayi to use padha aur in dono ke darmiyan kuchh na padha."
"903","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Ansari Sabit ke bete Adi se riwayat kya ke Khatmi Yazeed ke bete Abdullah ne unhein khabar di ke Ansari Abu Ayyub ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Hujjatul Wida mein Muzdalifa mein Maghrib aur Isha dono ko jama karke padha."
"904","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Muzdalifa mein Maghrib aur Isha dono ko jama karke padhte they."
"905","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mina mein chaar wali namaz do rakat padhi aur Abu Bakr ne use Mina mein do rakat padhi aur Umar bin Khattab ne use Mina mein do rakat padhi aur Usman ne use Mina mein do rakat padhi apni hukumat ke nisf tak phir is ke baad poori ki."
"906","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab jab Makka aae to unhein do rakatein padhain phir munsarif hue aur kaha ke aye Makka walo apni namaz poori karo kyunke hum musafir qoum hain. Phir Umar bin Khattab ne Mina mein do rakatein padhin aur hamein khabar na pahunchi ke unhon ne un se koi cheez kahi."
"907","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Makka mein logon ko do rakatein padhain phir jab munsarif hue to kaha ke aye Makka walo apni namaz poori karo kyunke hum musafir qoum hain. Phir Umar ne Mina mein do rakatein padhin aur hamein khabar na pahunchi ke unhon ne un se koi cheez kahi. Malik se Makka walon ke bare mein pucha gaya ke Arafa mein un ki namaz kaisi hai, do rakatein ya chaar, aur hajiyon ke ameer ke bare mein agar Makka walon mein se ho ke kya wo Arafa mein Zuhr aur Asr chaar rakatein padhega ya do rakatein, aur muqeem hone mein Makka walon ki namaz kaisi hai. To Malik ne kaha ke Makka wale Arafa aur Mina mein jab tak wahan muqeem hon do do rakatein padhein, namaz qasar karein yahan tak ke Makka ki taraf lautein. Unhon ne kaha ke hajiyon ka ameer bhi agar Makka walon mein se ho to Arafa aur Mina ke dinon mein namaz qasar kare, aur agar koi Mina mein rehne wala muqeem ho to wo Mina mein namaz poori kare, aur agar koi Arafa mein rehne wala muqeem ho to wo wahan bhi namaz poori kare."
"908","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab Nahr ke din se agle din nikle jab din kuchh buland ho gaya to takbeer kahi to logon ne un ki takbeer se takbeer kahi, phir usi din dusri martaba nikle din buland hone ke baad to takbeer kahi to logon ne un ki takbeer se takbeer kahi, phir teesri martaba nikle jab suraj dhal gaya to takbeer kahi to logon ne un ki takbeer se takbeer kahi yahan tak ke takbeer muttasil ho aur Baitullah tak pahunche aur maloom ho ke Umar rami ke liye nikle hain. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm ye hai ke Tashreeq ke dinon mein takbeer namazon ke peechhe hai aur is ka awwal Nahr ke din Zuhr ki namaz ke peechhe imam ki takbeer aur log us ke sath hain aur is ka aakhir Tashreeq ke aakhri dinon mein se Subah ki namaz ke peechhe imam ki takbeer aur log us ke sath hain phir takbeer qata kare. Malik ne kaha ke Tashreeq ke dinon mein takbeer mardon aur auraton par hai jo jamaat mein ho ya akele ho, Mina mein ya tamam bahar ke mulkon mein, wajib hai, aur log is mein hajiyon ke imam aur Mina walon ki pairwi karte hain kyunke jab wo lautein aur ehram khatm ho to un ki pairwi karein yahan tak ke halal mein un jaisa hon, aur jo haji na ho wo un ki pairwi na kare magar Tashreeq ke dinon ki takbeer mein. Malik ne kaha ke gine hue din Tashreeq ke din hain."
"909","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bat-ha mein utre jo Zul Hulaifa mein hai aur wahan namaz padhi. Nafi ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar aisa karte they."
"910","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Muhassab mein Zuhr aur Asr aur Maghrib aur Isha padhte phir raat se Makka mein dakhil hote aur Baitullah ka tawaf karte."
"911","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke un ka khayal hai ke Umar bin Khattab mard bhejte they jo logon ko Aqaba ke peechhe se dakhil karte."
"912","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke hajiyon mein se koi Mina ki raaton ko Aqaba ke peechhe raat na guzare."
"913","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Mina ki raaton mein Makka mein raat guzarne ke bare mein ke koi raat na guzare magar Mina mein."
"914","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab pehle do jamron ke paas lamba wuqoof karte yahan tak ke khada thak jata."
"915","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar pehle do jamron ke paas lamba wuqoof karte, Allah ki takbeer kehte aur us ki tasbeeh aur hamd bayan karte aur Allah se dua mangte, aur Jamra-e-Aqaba ke paas wuqoof na karte."
"916","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jamra ki rami ke waqt takbeer kehte jab kankari phenkte. Aur mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne baaz ahl-e-ilm ko kehte suna ke kankariyan jin se jamrat ko rami kya jae khazf ki kankariyon jaisi hon. Malik ne kaha ke is se thodi badi mujhe zyada pasand hai."
"917","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jo Tashreeq ke darmiyani dinon mein se suraj ghurub ho jae jabke wo Mina mein ho to na nikle yahan tak ke agle din jamrat ko rami kare."
"918","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke log jab jamrat ko rami karte to paidal chalte jate aur laut te, aur sab se pehle sawaar hokar Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan gae."
"919","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se pucha ke Qasim Jamra-e-Aqaba ko kahan se rami karte they. To unhon ne kaha ke jahan se aasan ho. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se pucha gaya ke kya bache aur beemar ki taraf se rami ki jae. To unhon ne kaha ke haan, aur beemar tehqeeq kare jab us ki taraf se rami ki jae to takbeer kahe jabke wo apne thikane mein ho, aur khoon bahae, phir agar beemar Tashreeq ke dinon mein sehatmand ho jae to jis ki taraf se rami ki gayi thi use rami kare aur hadi wajib hokar de. Malik ne kaha ke main us par jo jamrat ko rami kare ya Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kare jabke wo baghair wuzu ke ho iada nahi samajhta lekin is ka irada na kare."
"920","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke teenon dinon mein jamrat ko rami na ki jae yahan tak ke suraj dhal jae."
"921","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Adi ke bete Aasim ke bete Abu Badah ne unhein apne walid se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne oonton ke charwahon ko Mina se bahar raat guzarne mein rukhsat di ke wo Nahr ke din rami karein phir agle din aur is ke baad wale din do dinon ke liye rami karein phir Nafar ke din rami karein."
"922","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Rabah ke bete Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein zikr karte suna ke charwahon ko raat mein rami karne ki rukhsat di gayi, wo kehte hain ke pehle zamane mein. Malik ne kaha ke us hadis ki tafseer jis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne oonton ke charwahon ko jamrat ki rami moakhir karne mein rukhsat di hamare khayal mein, wallahu alam, ke wo Nahr ke din rami karein, phir jab wo din guzar jae jo Nahr ke din ke baad hai to agle din se rami karein aur ye Nafar-e-Awwal ka din hai, to guzre hue din ke liye rami karein phir apne us din ke liye rami karein kyunke koi kisi cheez ki qaza nahi karta yahan tak ke us par wajib ho, phir jab us par wajib ho aur guzar jae to qaza is ke baad hoti hai, phir agar un ke liye nafar zahir ho to farigh ho gae, aur agar agle din tak thehrein to Nafar-e-Aakhir ke din logon ke sath rami karein aur nafar karein."
"923","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi ke bete Abu Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Ubaid ki beti Safiya bint Abi Ubaid ke bhai ki beti Muzdalifa mein nafas wali huin to wo aur Safiya peechhe reh gain yahan tak ke Nahr ke din suraj ghurub hone ke baad Mina aaein to Abdullah bin Umar ne in dono ko hukm diya ke jab aaein to jamra ko rami karein aur un dono par kuchh na samjha. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se us shakhs ke bare mein pucha gaya jo Mina ke baaz dinon mein jamrat mein se aik jamra bhool jae yahan tak ke shaam ho jae. Unhon ne kaha ke jab yaad aae rami kare jis ghadi yaad aae, raat ya din se, jaisa namaz padhta hai jab use bhoole phir yaad aae raat ya din mein, phir agar ye is ke baad ho ke wo rawana ho chuka ho jabke wo Makka mein ho ya wahan se nikalne ke baad to us par hadi hai."
"924","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi aur Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Arafa mein logon ko khutba diya aur unhein hajj ka muamla sikhaya aur un se kaha jo kaha ke jab Mina aao to jo jamra ko rami kare us ke liye wo halal ho gaya jo haji par haram tha siwae auraton aur khushbu ke, koi auraton ko na chhue aur na khushbu yahan tak ke Baitullah ka tawaf kare."
"925","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi aur Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo jamra ko rami kare phir halq ya qasar kare aur hadi zibah kare agar us ke sath ho to us ke liye wo halal ho gaya jo us par haram tha siwae auraton aur khushbu ke yahan tak ke Baitullah ka tawaf kare."
"926","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Hujjatul Wida ke saal nikle aur hum ne umre ka ehlal kya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis ke sath hadi ho wo hajj ka ehlal umre ke sath kare phir halal na ho yahan tak ke in dono se halal ho. Unhon ne kaha ke main Makka aayi jabke main haiza thi to maine Baitullah ka tawaf na kya aur na Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan, to maine is ki shikayat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ki to Aap ne farmaya ke apna sar kholo aur kanghi karo aur hajj ka ehlal karo aur umra chhor do. Unhon ne kaha ke maine aisa kya, phir jab hum ne hajj poora kar liya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhe Abu Bakr Siddiq ke bete Abdur Rahman ke sath Taneem ki taraf bheja to maine umra kya to Aap ne farmaya ke ye tumhare umre ki jagah hai. To jinhon ne umre ka ehlal kya tha unhon ne Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai kya phir is se halal hue, phir Mina se lautne ke baad apne hajj ke liye dusra tawaf kya, aur jo hajj ka ehlal karke aae they ya hajj aur umre ko jama karke aae they to unhon ne aik hi tawaf kya. Aur mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Aaisha se is jaisa riwayat kya."
"927","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni baaz hadi zibah ki aur Aap ke ilawa ne baaz zibah ki."
"928","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Makka aayi jabke main haiza thi to maine Baitullah ka tawaf na kya aur na Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan, to maine is ki shikayat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ki to Aap ne farmaya ke wohi karo jo haji karta hai siwae is ke ke Baitullah ka tawaf na karo aur na Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan yahan tak ke pak ho jao."
"929","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Huyay ki beti Safiya ko haiz aaya to is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya gaya to Aap ne farmaya ke kya wo hamein rokne wali hai. To kaha gaya ke us ne ifaza kar liya hai. To Aap ne farmaya ke phir to nahi."
"930","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke ya Rasulullah Huyay ki beti Safiya ko haiz aaya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shayad wo hamein roke, kya wo tumhare sath Baitullah ka tawaf na kar chuki. Unhon ne kaha ke kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya ke phir niklo."
"931","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad Abu Rijal se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke Momineen ki maan Aaisha jab hajj kartin aur un ke sath aisi auratein hotin jin ke haiz ka darr hota to unhein Nahr ke din aage kartin aur wo ifaza kartin, phir agar is ke baad haiz aata to un ka intezar na kartin aur unhein lekar nafar kartin jabke wo haiza hotin, jab wo ifaza kar chuki hotin."
"932","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Huyay ki beti Safiya ka zikr kya to Aap se kaha gaya ke use haiz aaya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shayad wo hamein rokne wali hai. To unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah us ne tawaf kar liya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir to nahi. Malik ne kaha ke Hisham ne kaha ke Urwa ne kaha ke Aaisha ne kaha. Aur hum is ka zikr karte hain to log apni auraton ko aage na karte agar ye unhein faida na deta, aur agar wo kehte jo kehte hain to Mina mein subah ko chhe hazaar se zyada haiza auratein hotin jo sab ifaza kar chuki hotin."
"933","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma ne unhein khabar di ke Malhan ki beti Umm Sulaim ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se fatwa manga jabke use haiz aaya tha ya wo nafas wali hui thi is ke baad ke us ne Nahr ke din ifaza kar liya tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use ijazat di aur wo nikal gayin."
"934","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Abu Zubair se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne baju mein mendhe ka, hiran mein bakri ka, khargosh mein bakri ke bache ka aur chuhiya mein oontni ke bache ka faisla kya."
"935","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Qarir ke bete Abdul Malik se, unhon ne Sireen ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke aik mard Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya aur kaha ke main aur mera sathi apne do ghode daudate hue ghati ke dahane tak muqabla karne nikle aur hum ne hiran paya jabke hum muhrim they to aap kya kehte hain. To Umar ne apne pehlu wale mard se kaha ke aao yahan tak ke main aur tum faisla karein. Unhon ne kaha ke unhon ne us par bakri ka faisla kya to wo mard peeth pher kar gaya jabke wo kehta tha ke ye Ameerul Momineen hiran mein faisla nahi kar sakte yahan tak ke faisle ke liye aik mard ko bulaya. To Umar ne mard ki baat suni aur use bulaya aur us se pucha ke kya tum Maida ki surat padhte ho. Unhon ne kaha ke nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke kya tum is mard ko jante ho jis ne mere sath faisla kya. To us ne kaha ke nahi. To unhon ne kaha ke agar tum mujhe khabar dete ke tum Maida ki surat padhte ho to main tumhein maar se dard deta, phir kaha ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala apni kitab mein kehte hain ke tum mein se do adil faisla karein, hadi jo Kaaba tak pahunche, aur ye Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman hain."
"936","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke un ke walid jangli gaye mein gaye aur hiranon mein se bakri mein bakri kehte they."
"937","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke wo Makka ke kabutaron mein kehte they ke jab qatal kiye jaein to bakri hai. Aur Malik ne us Makka wale mard ke bare mein kaha jo hajj ya umre ka ehram bandhe jabke us ke ghar mein Makka ke kabutaron ke bache hon aur wo un par band kar de aur wo mar jaein. To unhon ne kaha ke meri rai hai ke har bache ke badle bakri fidya de. Malik ne kaha ke main hamesha se sunta aaya hun ke shuturmurgh mein jab use muhrim qatal kare badna hai. Malik ne kaha ke meri rai hai ke shuturmurgh ke ande mein badna ki qeemat ka daswan hissa hai jaisa azaad aurat ke bache mein ghulam ya londi hai aur ghurr ki qeemat pachaas dinar hai aur ye us ki maan ki diyat ka daswan hissa hai, aur uqabon ya cheelon ya baazon ya gidhon mein se har cheez shikar hai jis ka badla diya jae ga jaisa shikar ka badla diya jata hai jab use muhrim qatal kare, aur har cheez jis ka fidya diya jae us ke chhote mein waisa hai jaisa us ke bade mein hota hai, ye to us jaisa hai jaisa azaad ke chhote aur bade ki diyat hai, wo dono aik darje mein barabar hain."
"938","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke aik mard Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya aur kaha ke aye Ameerul Momineen maine apne kode se tidiyan mari hain jabke main muhrim hun. To Umar ne us se kaha ke aik mutthi khana khilao."
"939","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke aik mard Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya aur un se tidiyon ke bare mein pucha jinhein us ne qatal kya tha jabke wo muhrim tha. To Umar ne Kaab se kaha ke aao yahan tak ke faisla karein. To Kaab ne kaha ke dirham. To Umar ne Kaab se kaha ke tum dirham pate ho ke khajoor tiddi se behtar hai."
"940","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Jazri Malik ke bete Abdul Karim se, unhon ne Abu Laila ke bete Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Ujra ke bete Kaab se riwayat kya ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath muhrim they to un ke sar mein juon ne takleef di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke apna sar mundein aur farmaya ke teen din roza rakho ya chhe miskeenon ko khilao, har insan ke liye do do mudd, ya bakri se nusuk karo, in mein se jo karo tumhare liye kafi hoga."
"941","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Qais ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne Hajjaj ke bete Abu Mujahid se, unhon ne Laila ke bete Ibn Abi Laila se, unhon ne Ujra ke bete Kaab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke shayad tumhein tumhare keede takleef de rahe hain. To maine kaha ke haan ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apna sar mundeo aur teen din roza rakho ya chhe miskeenon ko khilao ya bakri se nusuk karo."
"942","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Khurasani Abdullah ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Kufa mein Baram ke bazaar mein shaikh ne Ujra ke bete Kaab se bayan kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mere paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aae jabke main apne sathiyon ke liye deg ke neeche phoonk raha tha aur mera sar aur dadhi juon se bhar gaya tha to unhon ne meri peshani pakdi phir farmaya ke in baalon ko mundeo aur teen din roza rakho ya chhe miskeenon ko khilao. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jante they ke mere paas wo nahi jis se main nusuk karun."
"943","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Tamima ke bete Abi Tamima Ayyub se, unhon ne Jubair ke bete Saeed se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo apne nusuk mein se koi cheez bhoole ya chhore to khoon bahae. Ayyub ne kaha ke main nahi janta ke unhon ne kaha ke chhore ya bhoole. Malik ne kaha ke jo is mein se hadi ho wo Makka ke siwa na hogi aur jo is mein se nusuk ho wo hoga jahan nusuk wala chahe."
"944","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Isa se, unhon ne Aas ke bete Amr ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Mina mein logon ke liye khade hue jabke log Aap se puchh rahe they to Aap ke paas aik mard aaya aur Aap se kaha ke ya Rasulullah mujhe khabar na hui to maine zibah se pehle halq kar liya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke zibah karo aur koi harj nahi. Phir Aap ke paas dusra aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah mujhe khabar na hui to maine rami se pehle zibah kar liya. Aap ne farmaya ke rami karo aur koi harj nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kisi cheez ke bare mein na pucha gaya jo aage ya peechhe ki gayi magar Aap ne farmaya ke karo aur koi harj nahi."
"945","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab jang ya hajj ya umre se laut te to zameen ki har bulandi par teen takbeerein kehte phir kehte ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wahda hu la shareeka lah, us ke liye badshahi hai aur us ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, lautne wale tauba karne wale ibadat karne wale sajda karne wale apne Rab ki hamd karne wale, Allah ne apna wada sach kya aur apne bande ki madad ki aur grohon ko tanha shikast di."
"946","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Uqba ke bete Ibrahim se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas ke azad karda Kuraib se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik aurat ke paas se guzre jabke wo apne kajave mein thi to us se kaha gaya ke ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain to us ne us bache ki kalai pakdi jo us ke sath tha aur kaha ke kya is ke liye hajj hai ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke haan aur tumhare liye ajr hai."
"947","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abla ke bete Abi Abla Ibrahim se, unhon ne Kuraiz ke bete Ubaidullah ke bete Talha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shaitan ko kisi din itna chhota aur dhutkara hua aur haqeer aur ghusse wala na dekha gaya jitna Arafa ke din mein, aur ye is ke siwa nahi jo us ne rehmat ke utarne aur Allah ke bade gunahon se darguzar karne se dekha, siwae is ke jo Badr ke din dekha gaya. Kaha gaya ke ya Rasulullah us ne Badr ke din kya dekha. Aap ne farmaya ke us ne Jibreel ko farishton ko jamate dekha tha."
"948","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ayyash ke bete Abdullah ke azad karda Ziyad bin Abi Ziyad se, unhon ne Kuraiz ke bete Ubaidullah ke bete Talha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke afzal dua Arafa ke din ki dua hai aur afzal jo maine kaha main aur mujh se pehle nabiyon ne, Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi wahda hu la shareeka lah."
"949","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fatah ke saal Makka mein dakhil hue jabke Aap ke sar par khud tha, phir jab use utara to Aap ke paas aik mard aaya aur Aap se kaha ke ya Rasulullah Khatal ka beta Kaaba ke pardon se lipta hua hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use qatal karo."
"950","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Makka se aae yahan tak ke jab Qudaid mein they to un ke paas Madina se khabar aayi to wo laute aur Makka mein baghair ehram ke dakhil hue. Aur mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se is jaisa riwayat kya."
"951","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab Nahr ke din se agle din nikle jab din kuchh buland ho gaya to takbeer kahi to logon ne un ki takbeer se takbeer kahi, phir usi din dusri martaba nikle din buland hone ke baad to takbeer kahi to logon ne un ki takbeer se takbeer kahi, phir teesri martaba nikle jab suraj dhal gaya to takbeer kahi to logon ne un ki takbeer se takbeer kahi yahan tak ke takbeer muttasil ho aur Baitullah tak pahunche aur maloom ho ke Umar rami ke liye nikle hain. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm ye hai ke Tashreeq ke dinon mein takbeer namazon ke peechhe hai aur is ka awwal Nahr ke din Zuhr ki namaz ke peechhe imam ki takbeer aur log us ke sath hain aur is ka aakhir Tashreeq ke aakhri dinon mein se Subah ki namaz ke peechhe imam ki takbeer aur log us ke sath hain phir takbeer qata kare. Malik ne kaha ke Tashreeq ke dinon mein takbeer mardon aur auraton par hai jo jamaat mein ho ya akele ho, Mina mein ya tamam bahar ke mulkon mein, wajib hai, aur log is mein hajiyon ke imam aur Mina walon ki pairwi karte hain kyunke jab wo lautein aur ehram khatm ho to un ki pairwi karein yahan tak ke halal mein un jaisa hon, aur jo haji na ho wo un ki pairwi na kare magar Tashreeq ke dinon ki takbeer mein. Malik ne kaha ke gine hue din Tashreeq ke din hain."
"952","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Halahla Dili ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad se, unhon ne Ansari Imran ke bete Muhammad se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Abdullah bin Umar ki taraf hata jabke main Makka ke raaste bargad ke darakht ke neeche utara hua tha to unhon ne kaha ke tumhein is bargad ke neeche kis ne utara. To maine kaha ke maine us ka saya chaha. To unhon ne kaha ke kya is ke ilawa. To maine kaha ke nahi, mujhe is ke siwa kuchh ne na utara. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum Mina ke do Akhshabon ke darmiyan ho, aur unhon ne apne haath se mashriq ki taraf phoonka, to wahan aik wadi hai jise Sarar kaha jata hai, is mein darakht hai jis ke neeche sattar nabi thehre."
"953","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Mulaika ke bete Ibn Abi Mulaika se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab kodh wali aurat ke paas se guzre jabke wo Baitullah ka tawaf kar rahi thi to unhon ne us se kaha ke aye Allah ki bandi logon ko takleef na de, agar tum apne ghar mein baithtin. To wo baith gayin, phir un ke paas se is ke baad aik mard guzra aur un se kaha ke jis ne tumhein mana kya tha wo mar gaya hai to niklo. To unhon ne kaha ke main zinda mein us ki itaat karun aur mare hue mein us ki nafarmani karun, aisa kabhi na hoga."
"954","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Abbas kehte they ke Rukn aur Darwaze ke darmiyan Multazam hai."
"955","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Habban ke bete Muhammad bin Yahya se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein zikr karte suna ke aik mard Rabaza mein Zarr ke bete Abu Zarr par guzra aur Abu Zarr ne us se pucha ke tum kahan chahte ho. To us ne kaha ke maine hajj ka irada kya hai. To unhon ne kaha ke kya tumhein is ke ilawa ne ubhara. To us ne kaha ke nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke phir amal ko mukammal karo. Mard ne kaha ke main nikla yahan tak ke Makka aaya aur jitna Allah ne chaha thehra, phir main logon ko aik mard par toote hue paya to maine logon se us par bheed ki to main us shaikh ko paya jise maine Rabaza mein paya tha, yani Abu Zarr. Unhon ne kaha ke jab unhon ne mujhe dekha to mujhe pehchana aur kaha ke yehi wo hai jo maine tumhein bayan kya tha."
"956","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se istisna ke bare mein pucha hajj mein. To unhon ne kaha ke kya koi aisa karta hai aur is ka inkar kya. Malik se pucha gaya ke kya mard apne janwar ke liye Haram se ghaas kaate. To unhon ne kaha ke nahi."
"957","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke wo kehti thin ke roza us ke liye hai jo umre se hajj tak tamattu kare, jo hadi na paye, is ke darmiyan ke wo hajj ka ehlal kare Arafa ke din tak, phir agar roza na rakhe to Mina ke dinon mein roza rakhe. Aur mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo is bare mein Aaisha ke qaul jaisa kehte they."
